iotBraem/better-near-auth/commits/6b34247c497a4dfa8cb2c6a3bc9879b5cb50eafe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T02:13:01Z","email":"elliot@ejlbraem.com","name":"Elliot Braem"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T02:14:03Z","email":"elliot@ejlbraem.com","name":"Elliot Braem"},"message":"chore: regen skills for 1.8.3 — auth-plugin body + 1.8.1 getNearClient migration across tanstack and _artifacts\n\nRebased onto origin/main after the 1.8.3 release (#70). Stamps swept to 1.8.3 to match package.json.\n\nStamps bumped:\n- skills/{auth-plugin, subaccount}/SKILL.md: 1.7.3 → 1.8.3 (full re-author for auth-plugin, stamp-only for subaccount)\n- skills/_artifacts/{skill_tree.yaml, domain_map.yaml, skill_spec.md}: library version 1.7.3 → 1.8.3\n\nDrift fix (1.8.1 breaking change):\n- authClient.near.client getter was removed; replaced with authClient.near.getNearClient()\n- skills/tanstack/SKILL.md: 3 executable samples + 1 HIGH failure-mode heading + descriptive note updated\n- skills/_artifacts/domain_map.yaml: client/tanstack/auth-plugin failure modes updated with the 1.8.1 mechanism note and renamed executable patterns\n- skills/_artifacts/skill_spec.md: client/tanstack/auth-plugin failure-mode rows updated; 1 new auth-plugin mistake added\n\n1.8.x additions documented:\n- 1.8.0: authClient.near.detectNearAccount() — added to client description\n- 1.8.2: signIn.near and near.link notify session atom — added to auth-plugin route-protection gotcha\n\nHistorical 1.8.2 prose references are preserved (they describe what the 1.8.2 patch did).\n\nNo automation: scripts/sync-example-version.mjs only syncs example apps, not skills. Drift may recur; pinned at 1.8.3 for now.","tree":{"sha":"4e340b905b9a9ccee22d0b59aa2f695ab913240d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elliotBraem/better-near-auth/git/trees/4e340b905b9a9ccee22d0b59aa2f695ab913240d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elliotBraem/better-near-auth/git/commits/6b34247c497a4dfa8cb2c6a3bc9879b5cb5