282460,"login":"elliotBraem","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjgyNDYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elliotBraem/better-near-auth/commits/34f43b84574c324ef6f58a608f7861536e7675db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T03:33:18Z","email":"elliot@ejlbraem.com","name":"Elliot Braem"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T03:33:18Z","email":"elliot@ejlbraem.com","name":"Elliot Braem"},"message":"feat: pre-flight sub-account availability check\n\n- Auth required: checkSubAccountAvailability now requires an authenticated session with a linked NEAR wallet\n- NEAR-valid regex: Added SUB_ACCOUNT_LABEL_REGEX matching NEAR account label rules\n- Length validation: Sub-account names enforce min 2, max 64 characters; composed accountId checked\n- Enriched response: Returns parentAccount and reason field (taken | invalid | too-long | not-configured)\n- Relayer decoupled: Availability check reads parentAccount from config — no relayer init required\n- Client-side guard: Short-circuits with reason: invalid for obviously invalid input\n- Demo UI: New SubAccountAvailabilityCard on /accounts with auth gate and reason-aware status\n- Code quality: Extracted shared AvailabilityStatus component and LABEL_REGEX constant\n- Bug fix: oRPC contract field subAccountId renamed to subAccountName; auth middleware added","tree":{"sha":"e04472904e720fba52928982daed339838da9b6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elliotBraem/better-near-auth/git/trees/e04472904e720fba52928982daed339838da9b6b"},"url":"ht