users/0xjesus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xjesus","id":20134752,"login":"0xjesus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTM0NzUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xjesus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xjesus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xjesus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xjesus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xjesus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xjesus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elliotBraem/better-near-auth/commits/743bb567d5620790450d89e11d0321582586cc3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T02:30:56Z","email":"pdlgmcn@protonmail.com","name":"0xJesus"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T02:30:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: accept optional callbackUrl so redirect-wallet NEP-413 signatures verify (#52)\n\nRedirect-based web wallets (e.g. MyNearWallet''s full-page mobile flow) include\nthe callbackUrl inside the signed NEP-413 payload, per the wallet standard.\n/near/verify and /near/link-account reconstructed the payload with\ncallbackUrl: null, so signatures from those wallets could never verify.\n\nAdd an optional callbackUrl field to VerifyRequest/LinkAccountRequest and pass\nit through to verifyNep413Signature (near-kit already serializes it).\nBackward compatible: popup/extension flows omit the field and are unaffected.","tree":{"sha":"d7ad9a4ed5b8489074e31d0be70ca9d54309663e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elliotBraem/better-near-auth/git/trees/d7ad9a4ed5b8489074e31d0be70ca9d54309663e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elliotBraem/better-near-auth/git/commits/743bb567d5620790450d89e11d0321582586cc3d","verification":{"payload":"tree d7ad9a4ed5b8489074e31d0be70ca9d54309663e\nparent fca844160871fbfc194e33f5740ee6b64879939f\nauthor 0xJesus <pdlgmcn@protonmail.com> 1783391456 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783391456 -0500\n\nfix: accept optional callbackUrl so redirect-wallet NEP-413 signatures verify (#52)\n\nRedirect-based web wallets (e.g. MyNearWallet''s full-page mobile flow) include\nthe callbackUrl inside the signed NEP-413 payload, per the wallet standard.\n/near/verify and /near/link-account reconstructed the payload with\ncallbackUrl: null, so signatures from those wallets could never verify.\n\nAdd an optional callbackUrl field to VerifyRequest/LinkAccountRequest and pass\nit through to verifyNep413Signature (near-kit already serializes it).\nBackward compatible: popup/extension flows omit the field and are unaffected.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTGTgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADKwQAC1d6EO7Q/q2RVeYajdJSay3\nP+ysBK1fw1OpMQEyia+ULHX/8TCq0r1/eOY975i8lHT8DUv8xyKcZZe65o2p6sS6\nCJpfU068RqfCruYs7eiJZE8Yzn1KvQoyiHM4fu/Xja6riwfc8nrJRdxAjS6k7Gq+\njnSaKI0GEG4WmPhReYqp2OduxqyPk8B/DHdTv3jDsMS091ySfTQdypB74oLb64Of\nrtSpZnF31Xxl7Y1RvGGET0xtv7Gg03VSqrJUZ+AEoMDjG2mH3hnm+Hv6C+YH5YpB\nRpGhOL3MG4eJU5ag9UhmIt3Hmyc8opxZTxv6mRQOpGkN93BRaFG/vVIt4VLC4Rnt\nRI992OIOiPJJiIbvKVDLGfegk4FKr4i6FbUUfCTcOTDLTIpe/LZbpYFwShAVJXhw\nc+eqgPR59k4l6meyntPTgQl9cExghAWPG79K6VJpR9Bb2qit97p+2FmUtih+/gIq\nVr6oYVIYdegVphzdWPcuPofN9KiIy4NVRt5Eulo5Is22EFazuHR03gqeYB2Shw3p\nf2zDQ5iC2UWDJdHNC6dzBbAlaXTHS4hFaXCDvuYwjLigk4z0Qt+9NtrY1eeQQZxh\nis5cQe4D1DfHUaJPHUDlHMIhP1TkKqvisv0wPzYBqMfajBchd6so7AzU6+pvbeRa\nasP12hI2NvAHrwj1wZEZ\n=qIaR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-07T02:30:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","grava