rinciples\n\n- Introduced Module 2: M - Microservices, covering key concepts such as high cohesion, low coupling, and bounded contexts.\n- Added Module 3: A - API-First Design, focusing on the API-first approach and its benefits for parallel development.\n- Created Module 4: C - Cloud-Native Systems, detailing fault tolerance patterns and the importance of observability.\n- Developed Module 5: H - Headless Architecture, explaining the decoupling of front-end and back-end systems.\n- Established Module 6: Applying MACH in Practice, emphasizing the use of Architecture Decision Records (ADRs) and practical applications of MACH principles.\n- Updated overview and detailed training plan documents to align with new modules and resources.","tree":{"sha":"6f0955bd014aed724c8abf6f70335cfde4b66db0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/craigbekker/engineering-practice/git/trees/6f0955bd014aed724c8abf6f70335cfde4b66db0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/craigbekker/engineering-practice/git/commits/ca6684c8581abc1b4cb6a491a929f8d429c2b012","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1115912?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craigbekker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craigbekker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craigbekker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craigbekker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/craigbekker","id":1115912,"login":"craigbekker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTU5MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craigbekker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craigbekker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craigbekker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craigbekker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.git