EricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/50253b089b7e82b10081cd49f2840af43216d158/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T21:53:05Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T21:53:05Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"feat(yuheng): 在单SPA完成模型、知识与Wiki工作区\n\nStep 15：员工知识工作区与模型网关配置在同一 SPA 内落地，按各自 read 能力\n放行，不复用也不放宽旧管理根的 yuheng:read。\n\n- typed client 逐项对齐 API-004..007 / 008..022 / 023..028+031，命令体不带\n  actorId/tenantId，ID 保持 string，mutation 一律 retry:false\n- 知识库/文档/成员/任务/答案与 Wiki 编辑-发布-图谱面板；403 清除已读投影，\n  409 保留用户编辑，任务轮询随页面可见性与终态停止\n- 模型页只显示密钥引用名，EMBEDDING 路由含 CLOUD 时前端直接拒绝不发请求\n- 导航剪枝改为按能力表 fail-closed，既有条目可见性不变\n- 46 项 focused 组件测试 + 全量 183 项通过；本 Step 未写任何配置","tree":{"sha":"44e3093a3e88cef19002788585ad11147950df42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/44e3093a3e88cef19002788585ad11147950df42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/50253b089b7e82b10081cd49f2840af43216d158","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/50253b089b7e82b10081cd49f2840af43216d158","node_id":"C_kwDOPfC-mdoAKDUwMjUzYjA4OWI3ZTgyYjEwMDgxY2Q0OWYyODQwYWY0MzIxNmQxNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/a3e8dc1eb8aca92ee4df195424b61a46c02d3508","sha":"a3e8dc1eb8aca92ee4df195424b61a46c02d3508","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/a3e8dc1eb8aca92ee4df195424b61a46c02d3508"}],"sha":"50253b089b7e82b10081cd49f2840af43216d158","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/50253b089b7e82b10081cd49f2840af43216d158"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/a3e8dc1eb8aca92ee4df195424b61a46c02d3508/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T21:20:55Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T21:20:55Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"docs(yuheng-plan): 以附录 A7 登记 Step 14 交付、装配缺口与两处生产修正\n\nStep 14 的 22 个代码路径已在 fd8795411 提交；本提交只追加附录，不改写上方任何行号。\n附录记录了三类执行期事实：一是 Plan 漏声明的 wikiPublicationPolicyStrategyRegistry\n装配 bean（缺了它 Spring 上下文无法启动，且故意不要求枚举全覆盖，避免 REVIEW_REQUIRED\n被伪装成有策略）；二是两个由命名测试暴露的真实生产缺陷——发布路径上审计摘要\nMap.copyOf 对 null 值抛 NPE（每次发布都会 500），以及 CAS 冲突异常被 catch 链\n误分类为依赖不可用（Spec 稳定错误码表证明测试是对的）；三是口径校正：目录分页\n上限按 §9.2 从 @Max(100) 收紧为 20，测试夹具向生产契约（冻结意图 + S<n> 引用号）\n对齐而非削弱生产的防幻觉保证。\n\n聚焦测试 10/0/0/0，模块全量 339/0/0/0；未写任何配置文件，Rule 7 与 MC-CONFIG-001\n仍为证据支撑的 N/A，所有运行期口径登记为 Runtime unverified。","tree":{"sha":"34904d0aca4a280d0c06459b58c6ec846ee365c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/34904d0aca4a280d0c06459b58c6ec846ee365c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/a3e8dc1eb8aca92ee4df195424b61a46c02d3508","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/a3e8dc1eb8aca92ee4df195424b61a46c02d3508","node_id":"C_kwDOPfC-mdoAKGEzZThkYzFlYjhhY2E5MmVlNGRmMTk1NDI0YjYxYTQ2YzAyZDM1MDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/fd87954114bf91b10d550b3b971083d82607c4b7","sha":"fd87954114bf91b10d550b3b971083d82607c4b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/fd87954114bf91b10d550b3b971083d82607c4b7"}],"sha":"a3e8dc1eb8aca92ee4df195424b61a46c02d3508","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/a3e8dc1eb8aca92ee4df195424b61a46c02d3508"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/fd87954114bf91b10d550b3b971083d82607c4b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T21:17:44Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T21:17:44Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"feat(yuheng): 实现Wiki完整状态机与DIRECT自动发布\n\nStep 14 交付：Wiki 页面/修订载体、守卫式仓储与指针 CAS、DIRECT 发布策略与\n发布策略注册表、生成 worker 策略、管理 HTTP 入口与三个持久化转换器。\n\n状态机口径：DIRECT_PUBLISH 只推进状态与 publication_version，COMMIT_PUBLICATION\n才在同一调用序列里旧化上一版并切换 page 指针，UNPUBLISH 归档并清空已发布指针；\npage.revision 与 revision.publication_version 双 CAS，零行命中一律换算为冲突而不\n是成功。批次发布只有一次事务，任一页冲突即整批中止，且页面 CAS 落空现在按\nWIKI_STATE_CONFLICT 收束（此前会落入依赖不可用的兜底分支并误记 unexpected）。\n\n审核入口（SUBMIT_REVIEW/APPROVE/REVIEWED_PUBLISH）保持失败关闭为\nWIKI_REVIEW_ADAPTER_NOT_CONFIGURED，DIRECT 路径永不写 APPROVED，审计摘要的\nreviewDecisionCode 固定 NOT_REQUIRED；审计摘要对被清空的指针以空串表达，避免\nMap.copyOf 在真正发布时抛空指针。\n\n按用户裁定不写任何配置文件，运行期配置由使用者启动时补充；配置一致性门（Rule 7\n/MC-CONFIG-001）因此为有据 N/A，跨进程 SQL 与真实 PG 行为仍为 Runtime unverified。","tree":{"sha":"af295b9ca96bf513227a49f9eb57859aef0206f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/af295b9ca96bf513227a49f9eb57859aef0206f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/fd87954114bf91b10d550b3b971083d82607c4b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander