s://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/5efbb1f23abdbc6752dc556f969e8f63c5334006/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T19:27:13Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T19:27:13Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"feat(yuheng): 完成授权检索与来源可追溯问答\n\nStep 13 交付 API-022 的检索侧：授权谓词全部落在 KnowledgeChunkDAO 的两条具名\nSQL 里（租户、成员 jsonb、文档活动修订、冻结嵌入空间与维度、软删），向量路按\ncosine_distance 升序产出 score=1-distance 并以分块主键确定并列，关键词路只做转义\n后的字面子串匹配，混合路由两条已授权腿以 RRF(k=60) 融合并按稳定分块标识去重。\n模式分发经 knowledgeSearchStrategyRegistry 枚举注册表在启动期 fail-closed，\n交付前重读成员资格并逐条复核活动修订，无证据走 NO_EVIDENCE 且生成调用为零。\n\n未写任何配置文件：每路 50 候选、topK 缺省 8 上限 20、提示词 60000 字符与 5 秒检索\n预算都是实现内的显式常量，待用户补配置时替换读取点。","tree":{"sha":"4605ff1dd5c3c9bb8bd1050904934eb04786ee21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/4605ff1dd5c3c9bb8bd1050904934eb04786ee21"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/5efbb1f23abdbc6752dc556f969e8f63c5334006","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_