af8256f7c1b72d5909fbd960bd40cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T18:50:00Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T18:50:00Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"feat(yuheng): 完成资料上传、摄取任务与原子版本发布\n\n上传在同一事务内落文档行+STAGING修订(原件字节/字节数/SHA-256)+DOCUMENT_INGEST\n作业，并按 Idempotency-Key 复用 gateway_idempotency_record；摄取只在 worker 侧以\nSKIP LOCKED 认领、lease_token 单调 +1 与 30s/120s 租约 fencing 执行，模型调用全部\n在事务与锁之外，发布走 active_revision_id 的 revision CAS 恰一次，因此部分嵌入失败\n或被接管的租约都留下原活动修订可查。\n\n作业分派由 KnowledgeJobStrategy + 启动期 EnumMap 注册表承担（重复或空注册即启动失败，\n已认领但缺策略者按 KNOWLEDGE_STRATEGY_UNAVAILABLE 收口），无类型 switch。\nAPI-017 改走 Starter 的带版本逻辑删除，只写 deleted_at 与 version，历史保留。","tree":{"sha":"8bab92532763f2c9225692d9c15e6efe6bfcaf24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/8bab92532763f2c9225692d9c15e6efe6bfcaf24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/94a6e8b7b5af8256f7c1b72d5909fbd960bd40cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com