api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/704fa778009e08d5a214d9ea57fda95d187bbf6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:17:46Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:17:46Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"docs(plan): record Step 11 delivery and the Step 10 port correction\n\nAppend 附录 A4 for the four-protocol fidelity Step: both green gates, the\nuser-directed no-YAML ruling that makes Rule 7 an evidence-backed N/A, the\nrouted-candidates contract gap found while wiring the controller, and the\nfour registered limitations carried into the final audit.","tree":{"sha":"30d49b600786f2f4fc0d7a4036f98ee39faffa44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/30d49b600786f2f4fc0d7a4036f98ee39faffa44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/704fa778009e08d5a214d9ea57fda95d187bbf6e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/704fa778009e08d5a214d9ea57fda95d187bbf6e","node_id":"C_kwDOPfC-mdoAKDcwNGZhNzc4MDA5ZTA4ZDVhMjE0ZDllYTU3ZmRhOTVkMTg3YmJmNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/4e0b90283d4af5637fb4426b70bbb816cac547a1","sha":"4e0b90283d4af5637fb4426b70bbb816cac547a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/4e0b90283d4af5637fb4426b70bbb816cac547a1"}],"sha":"704fa778009e08d5a214d9ea57fda95d187bbf6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/704fa778009e08d5a214d9ea57fda95d187bbf6e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/4e0b90283d4af5637fb4426b70bbb816cac547a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:12:23Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:12:23Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"feat(llm-gateway): four-protocol fidelity and the bounded streaming barrier\n\nPlan Step 11. The model entry now leaves natively in all four managed\nprotocols and stops pretending otherwise:\n\n- LlmProtocolStrategy is the protocol-face SPI (encodeRequest /\n  decodeUnaryResponse / encodeStream / encodeError / exchange), resolved by\n  LlmProtocolEnum through the fixed four-entry registry, so no protocol\n  branch survives anywhere in the chain (Rule 9).\n- The four adapters pin their native wire shapes: Chat tool_calls ids, delta\n  ordering and the single [DONE]; Embeddings ordered input, float vectors and\n  an exact count/index/width match with a stream refused fail-closed;\n  Responses store=false with typed events, monotonic sequence numbers and\n  completed/incomplete/failed terminals; Messages top-level system, content\n  block order, thinking signatures, verbatim partial_json accumulation and the\n  {\"type\":\"error\",\"error\":{...}} face that never borrows the OpenAI shape.\n- Streams are bounded: real SSE framing over the raw byte flux, prefetch of\n  one frame, per-frame and total byte ceilings, cancellation propagated\n  upstream, each DataBuffer released exactly once, and a commit barrier that\n  validates one complete frame before any status is fixed and afterwards may\n  only end the stream - never a model switch, a retry, a status rewrite or a\n  fabricated terminal frame.\n- LlmApiController carries the Spec API-001/002/003/029/030 paths and\n  operationIds, reads the body within max-request-bytes before routing,\n  performs a startup registry self-check that fails closed, and encodes every\n  failure natively instead of in the admin code/data envelope.\n- LlmInvocationException is the only error carrier allowed on the wire: four\n  safe fields, no cause, so nothing upstream can be echoed.\n\nNo configuration YAML was written, per the user directive. Gates: this module\n31/31 (LlmProtocolContractTest 25 + LlmRoutingContractTest 6) and\nyuheng-admin 309/309 architecture contracts, both BUILD SUCCESS offline.","tree":{"sha":"8532693d4087af8a4aacb47517db3dbb753519ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/8532693d4087af8a4aacb47517db3dbb753519ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/4e0b90283d4af5637fb4426b70bbb816cac547a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/4e0b90283d4af5637fb4426b70bbb816cac547a1","node_id":"C_kwDOPfC-mdoAKDRlMGI5MDI4M2Q0YWY1NjM3ZmI0NDI2YjcwYmJiODE2Y2FjNTQ3YTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/fb09b8d15a93d1568ca0839a23c5293ab955939c","sha":"fb09b8d15a93d1568ca0839a23c5293ab955939c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/fb09b8d15a93d1568ca0839a23c5293ab955939c"}],"sha":"4e0b90283d4af5637fb4426b70bbb816cac547a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/4e0b90283d4af5637fb4426b70bbb816cac547a1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/fb09b8d15a93d1568ca0839a23c5293ab955939c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:12:21Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:12:21Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"fix(llm-gateway): hand the routed candidates to the protocol face\n\nStep 10''s invoke() returned only a status and safe headers, so the Step 11\norchestrator had to re-read the alias snapshot and re-run the weighted\nselection just to obtain a route: two admission decisions, two configuration\nreads and a possibly different channel pick per request. The routed VO now\ncarries the ordered candidates the routing pass already produced, so one\nrequest means one snapshot, one admission decision and one weighted draw, and\nthe remaining candidates stay available for the at-most-N safe attempts the\nrouting javadoc already promised.\n\nCorrective commit attributed to Plan Step 10 per the executing-plan rule.","tree":{"sha":"6cdb6b34d4133cc2b04882e4cd7a09f5e45901f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/6cdb6b34d4133cc2b04882e4cd7a09f5e45901f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/fb09b8d15a93d1568ca0839a23c5293ab955939c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexande