exander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/e5529cfd356a048c1538dbfb6cba4612284b1a6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T13:55:17Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T13:55:17Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"feat(yuheng): 完成LLM配置管理和本地embedding路由\n\nStep 10 落地 LLM 配置管理面与数据面请求模型，共 29 个声明路径：\n\n- yuheng-admin：LlmChannelBO/LlmModelBO 业务载体、LlmConfigurationRepository 端口与\n  MpLlmConfigurationRepository 实现（复用 EgonColaRepository 的租户/软删除/乐观锁语义）、\n  4 个 MapStruct 转换器（BO↔PO 走 BaseConverter，BO→VO 走 BaseForwardConverter，\n  unmappedTargetPolicy=ERROR）、LlmConfigurationService/Impl 与\n  LlmConfigurationController（GET/PUT channels/{channelKey}、models/{modelKey}，\n  201+Location/200/404/409/422 复用既有 revision 语义）。\n- yuheng-llm-gateway：LlmChannelPO/LlmModelPO + 具名查询 DAO/XML、\n  LlmModelSnapshotBO 只读一致快照、LlmInvocationCommandDTO/LlmInvocationResultVO、\n  数据面 LlmConfigurationRepository 端口与 Mp 实现、LlmRouteSelectionStrategy\n  （引擎开关→alias 存在→授权→出域许可→本地 embedding 硬校验→六项资格过滤→优先级+带权）、\n  LlmInvocationService/Impl、LlmGatewayProperties、LlmGatewayConfiguration 与\n  LlmClientCredentialFilter（向下游只呈现 Bearer，隐藏 x-api-key）。\n- 新增命名测试 LlmRoutingContractTest 固定「过滤先于加权选择、云 embedding 尝试数恒为 0」。\n\n按用户当面指令，本 Step 不写任何 application*.yml：配置键移交运维在启动期补齐，\nRule 7 与运行期断言据此记为 N/A / Runtime unverified（详见 Plan 文末附录 A3）。\n\n验证：\n- ./mvnw -o -pl …/yuheng-llm-gateway -am -Dtest=LlmRoutingContractTest … test → Tests run: 6, Failures: 0, BUILD SUCCESS\n- ./mvnw -o -pl …/yuheng-admin test → Tests run: 309, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, BUILD SUCCESS","tree":{"sha":"8cf418c9dfdeac27f146bf37df50a966e1593fbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/8cf418c9dfdeac27f146bf37df50a966e1593fbc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/e5529cfd356a048c1538dbfb6cba4612284b1a6e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/e5529cfd356a048c1538dbfb6cba4612284b1a6e","node_id":"C_kwDOPfC-mdoAKGU1NTI5Y2ZkMzU2YTA0OGMxNTM4ZGJmYjZjYmE0NjEyMjg0YjFhNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/554b4