ps://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/88a6eb1f930a15145c94e0f3e694710b21f4eab3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T09:22:52Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T09:22:52Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"feat(yuheng): 切换唯一MP数据源并建立空库受管DDL\n\nStep 9（Files 1-16/24/25）。Admin 成为唯一持有受管 DDL 的进程，MCP/LLM 降为 schema\n消费者；JPA 与运行期 Flyway 彻底移除（flyway 仅 test 作用域继续证明 V1-V13 旧升级路径），\n@EntityScan/@EnableJpaRepositories 由 14 个 dao 包的 @MapperScan 取代，\nObjectOptimisticLockingFailureException 换成 org.springframework.dao 的\nOptimisticLockingFailureException。\n\n空库基线 49 张 *_t0 表按 egon-cola-source-web 模板写成 runner 合法形态：建表整体包进\nDO $egon$ 的 egon_migration.role=''SHARD'' 分支，随后无条件建 ddl_history\n（installedPrefix 见到非空 schema 而无 history 即抛 REBUILD_REQUIRED）；pgvector 改为\n安装期前置并在文件头声明。SHA256 由最终字节重算，与 repository-manifest.json 一致。\n\n三处 *PersistenceProperties 按 Rule 3 落为 Lombok class（AiCarrierContractTest 门禁 +\n既有 *Properties 形态），jakarta 约束逐字段保留、无默认租户；\nConfigurableListableBeanFactory 不再挂伪造的 @Qualifier(\"beanFactory\")，它是 resolvable\ndependency、并无此 bean 名。\n\n按用户当面指令，File 17-23（7 个 application*.yml）不由本 Step 写入，配置由运维启动时\n补齐；因此 Rule 7 配置键一致性与空库真建表、消费者就绪时序均为 Runtime unverified。\n\n验证：GatewayManagedDdlConfigurationTest 8/8；yuheng-admin 全量 309/309 BUILD SUCCESS；\nyuheng-mcp-gateway 与 yuheng-llm-gateway test-compile BUILD SUCCESS。","tree":{"sha":"e25a0a54ac78e21e0592e80cc451a3d7d39e9608","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/e25a0a54ac78e21e0592e80cc451a3d7d39e9608"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/88a6eb1f930a15145c94e0f3e694710b21f4eab3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/88a6eb1f930a15145c94e0f3e694710b21f4eab3","node_id":"C_kwDOPfC-mdoAKDg4YTZlYjFmOTMwYTE1MTQ1Yzk0ZTBmM2U2OTQ3MTBiMjFmNGVhYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/3f422c1b06646908debb0d54082d33e5299cdc98","sha":"3f422c1b06646908debb0d54082d33e5299cdc98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/3f422c1b06646908debb0d54082d33e5299cdc98"}],"sha":"88a6eb1f930a15145c94e0f3e694710b21f4eab3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/88a6eb1f930a15145c94e0f3e694710b21f4eab3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/3f422c1b06646908debb0d54082d33e5299cdc98/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T08:23:22Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T08:23:22Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"docs(plan): 记录 Step 8 落地裁定并推翻 et 参数误判\n\nStep 8 提交为 517aa6e80 后，Park 项②③的初判（自定义 XML 绕过\nEgonColaMetaObjectHandler）经代码核实为错误：MybatisParameterHandler 按保留键\net 从 ParamMap 取实体，所以 @Param(\"et\") 正是租户/审计/版本与主键生成的入口。\n④⑤记录的聚合查询已随 selectProtocolCalls/selectReleaseTotals/countActiveGroups\n落地，并把 Map 裸返回改为 List<Map> 以避开 MyBatis @MapKey 运行期缺陷。","tree":{"sha":"858d7defa507d0281b5342eb87e1315b234651dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/858d7defa507d0281b5342eb87e1315b234651dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/3f422c1b06646908debb0d54082d33e5299cdc98","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/3f422c1b06646908debb0d54082d33e5299cdc98","node_id":"C_kwDOPfC-mdoAKDNmNDIyYzFiMDY2NDY5MDhkZWJiMGQ1NDA4MmQzM2U1Mjk5Y2RjOTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/517aa6e80121278be5defd061ef5cfd9ccb0fd6a","sha":"517aa6e80121278be5defd061ef5cfd9ccb0fd6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/517aa6e80121278be5defd061ef5cfd9ccb0fd6a"}],"sha":"3f422c1b06646908debb0d54082d33e5299cdc98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/3f422c1b06646908debb0d54082d33e5299cdc98"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/517aa6e80121278be5defd061ef5cfd9ccb0fd6a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T08:19:50Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T08:19:50Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"feat(yuheng): 以 MyBatis-Plus 门面迁移审计、幂等与 Kafka 投影\n\nStep 8 退役 yuheng-admin 余下的三条手写 JDBC 端口（可观测性投影、管理面审计、\n幂等位点），改由受守卫的 EgonColaRepository 边界承载：租户过滤、活跃读取、\n技术列盖章与乐观锁 CAS 都只经边界，自定义 SQL 一律落 mapper XML。\n\n显式记录的偏差：\n- 重复投递仍靠 ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING 折成 0 行，而不是 save()+catch\n  DuplicateKeyException：PostgreSQL 任一语句报错都会把事务打成\n  current transaction is aborted，会连带废掉同事务内的分钟累积。\n- 到期回收由物理 DELETE 改为受守卫软删，行被隐藏而非回收（架构守卫禁止硬删）。\n- GatewayTraceVO/GatewayAuditVO 是 record，改由 XML 构造器 resultMap 位置装配，\n  门面不再手写行映射。\n- countActiveGroups 与 selectReleaseTotals 两张跨表只读语句托管在可观测性映射内。\n- 今日 Flyway 结构尚无 tenant_id/deleted_at/version 列，真实 SQL 执行留待 Step 9\n  的空库验收，本 Step 只给出源码与合同级证据。\n\n验证：./mvnw -o -pl .../yuheng-admin test → 301/301 通过（含新的\nGatewayKafkaMpProjectionTest 7 项、AiMpRepositoryContractTest、\nGatewayPersistenceBoundaryTest）。","tree":{"sha":"ca3bdbff6034731f09306b18b41a66e58bf93418","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/ca3bdbff6034731f09306b18b41a66e58bf93418"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/517aa6e80121278be5defd061ef5cfd9ccb0fd6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/517aa6e80121278be5defd061ef5cfd9ccb0fd6a","node_id":"C_kwDOPfC-mdoAKDUxN2FhNmU4MDEyMTI3OGJlNWRlZmQwNjFlZjVjZmQ5Y2NiMGZkNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/2be7d09f57fddb62f12e9d16cfde08c0025afa45","sha":"2be7d09f57fddb62f12e9d16cfde08c0025afa45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/2be7d09f57fddb62f12e9d16cfde08c0025afa45"}],"sha":"517aa6e80121278be5defd061ef5cfd9ccb0fd6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/517aa6e80121278be5defd061ef5cfd9ccb0fd6a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/2be7d09f57fddb62f12e9d16cfde08c0025afa45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T08:05:54Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T08:05:54Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"docs(yuheng-plan): record Step 8''s blocking contract drift before any commit\n\nThe three subagent artifacts landed, so re-inspection replaced assumption with\nevidence: the DAO interfaces were rewritten with flat parameters while both\nMapper XMLs bind #{query.*} and emit VOs through constructor resultMaps, and\nPostgreSQL aborts the whole transaction on any statement error, which makes the\n\"guarded save + catch DuplicateKeyException\" idempotency pattern unsound. The\npark list now fixes the convergence direction (query-object contract, check-then\ninsert, accumulate as a pure update) and names the two still-missing statements.","tree":{"sha":"3fc7e484ac5cb2acab58f28e0148ed553fa0424e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/3fc7e484ac5cb2acab58f28e0148ed553fa0424e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/2be7d09f57fddb62f12e9d16cfde08c0025afa45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/A