mitted and record its three deviations\n\nAnnotate the MCP control-plane Step with its commit hash and file count so a\nfuture session never re-runs it, and record the obligations the Step could not\nsatisfy: the shared persistence integration test needs a real PostgreSQL and a\nlive MP session, so it moves to Step 9 together with the two fail-closed gateway\npersistence keys and the hand-written gateway converters.","tree":{"sha":"9f46b2962d3bc9bdc8af427abd846aca58f94517","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/9f46b2962d3bc9bdc8af427abd846aca58f94517"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/aaa1dc496683ff99d8e02b0c8236db3210a19b68","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/aaa1dc496683ff99d8e02b0c8236db3210a19b68","node_id":"C_kwDOPfC-mdoAKGFhYTFkYzQ5NjY4M2ZmOTlkOGUwMmIwYzgyMzZkYjMyMTBhMTliNjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/841446b6445bbb5086f310fb069b113aae770c42","sha":"841446b6445bbb5086f310fb069b113aae770c42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/841446b6445bbb5086f310fb069b113aae770c42"}],"sha":"aaa1dc496683ff99d8e02b0c8236db3210a19b68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/aaa1dc496683ff99d8e02b0c8236db3210a19b68"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/841446b6445bbb5086f310fb069b113aae770c42/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T06:58:36Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T06:58:36Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"feat(yuheng): move the MCP control plane and the shared task/approval stores onto MP\n\nStep 7 of the yuheng LLM/knowledge/wiki plan. Both processes that share\ngateway_mcp_task_instance and gateway_mcp_approval now reach those tables\nthrough the Egon guarded MyBatis-Plus repository instead of hand-written\nJDBC, so tenant filtering, active-row reads and the technical version CAS\nare enforced in one place rather than per statement.\n\n- admin: 9 MP facades + 10 converters behind @Validated BO/VO ports; the\n  legacy record invariants move into validated()/normalized() on the\n  carriers and are called at the persistence read/write boundaries; the\n  lost-write shape left behind by dropping JpaRepository is fixed at three\n  mutation sites (server = servers.save(server)).\n- admin: approval token issuance, digest binding and expiry orchestration\n  move out of McpApprovalController into McpApprovalAdminService(Impl);\n  the HTTP path, status and response fields are unchanged.\n- gateway: McpTaskRecordPO/McpApprovalRecordPO + DAO/XML + guarded\n  repositories, MpMcpRuntimeTaskStore and MpMcpApprovalAdapter replace the\n  two Jdbc adapters, and McpGatewayPersistenceContext supplies the\n  deployment-bound tenant and technical principal that MDC cannot carry on\n  a Reactor thread.\n- JdbcMcp*Repository (9), McpJdbcJson, McpCapabilityBinding, both Jdbc\n  gateway adapters, JdbcMcpControlPlaneStoreTest and\n  McpTaskRecoveryPostgresqlIT are retired with their subjects; the\n  JDBC-only shared-store assertions cut from\n  GatewayMcpFlywayPostgresqlIT (revision, one-time approval, lease claim)\n  return as McpSharedPersistenceIT together with the Step 9 datasource\n  switch, because they need a real PostgreSQL through\n  MyBatis -> guard -> ShardingSphere -> PG.\n\nDeviations kept honest: yuheng-mcp-gateway has no MapStruct dependency, so\nits two converters are hand-written on the same BaseConverter contract\n(adding the annotation processor needs approval); the two new\nengine.mcp.persistence.* keys are deliberately fail-closed and their\nprofile entries belong to Step 9''s declared application.yml pair, so the\ngateway process is not bootable until then; MyBatis mapper-locations and\nthe mapper scan likewise land in Step 9.\n\nGate: yuheng-mcp-gateway 42/42, yuheng-admin 295/295, BUILD SUCCESS.\nRuntime-unverified by design until Step 9 (no database or Docker started).","tree":{"sha":"8842740e7235c0aad284cc477aa1d4143cbb824e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/8842740e7235c0aad284cc477aa1d4143cbb824e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/841446b6445bbb5086f310fb069b113aae770c42","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/841446b6445bbb5086f310f