ander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/f64fff2ce423a6803ae8284333c4ea79f298b217/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T04:50:26Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T04:50:26Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"feat(yuheng-admin): move reporting, openapi and release persistence onto MP\n\nStep 6 replaces the last hand-written JDBC repositories of the reporting,\nopenapi and release packages with guarded MyBatis-Plus adapters. The six\nports no longer inherit Spring Data and are validated at the boundary, the\ncolumn translation lives in MapStruct converters layered on the Egon\nBaseConverter, and the legacy CAS, claimable-state, cleared-column and\nzero-rows-is-not-success predicates are reproduced wrapper by wrapper.\n\nGatewayPublicationMpTest now covers both halves of the step: the OpenAPI\njournal and snapshot facades plus the release registration, attempt journal,\npublication CAS and role-separated chunk GC, which the retired JDBC-only\ntests used to pin. Cross-tenant rows are rejected before a carrier is\nmaterialized, and a negative revision fails before any SQL is reached.\n\nDeviations: ten files in credential, mcp, observability and shared lost only\ntheir now-empty release/reporting repository.jdbc wildcard imports, and seven\nJDBC-only test classes named by the deleted subjects were retired with them.","tree":{"sha":"d2ece558c2da6536d9903bf8d69794f5872bd6b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/d2ece558c2da6536d9903bf8d69794f5872bd6b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/f64fff2ce423a6803ae8284333c4ea79f298b217","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/f64fff2ce423a6803ae8284333c4ea79f298b217","node_id":"C_kwDOPfC-mdoAKGY2NGZmZjJjZTQyM2E2ODAzYWU4Mjg0MzMzYzRlYTc5ZjI5OGIyMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/b039589bedd9e23be7dd4c69920bfd38a191e694","sha":"b039589bedd9e23be7dd4c69920bfd38a191e694","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/b039589bedd9e23be7dd4