","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/48326e2a3bcca6eb35e058c34ce80ddfb19af042/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T13:47:05Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T13:47:05Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"feat(yuheng-admin): add the 49-table MyBatis-Plus row models and guarded mapper baseline\n\nStep 3 of the yuheng LLM/knowledge/wiki Plan: every migrated table now has an\nEgonModel-derived row model, an EgonColaMapper access interface, a guarded\nmapper XML (active reads filter deleted_at, soft-delete is a tenant + original\nversion CAS) and an EgonColaRepository persistence boundary, so no later layer\nhas to reach for a raw Wrapper.\n\nAiMpRepositoryContractTest fixes that shape as the Step gate; the whole-module\nregression stays green at 279 tests.","tree":{"sha":"9575ed0f396cc26bc79d3812c690ff5ff5ebf392","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/9575ed0f396cc26bc79d3812c690ff5ff5ebf392"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/48326e2a3bcca6eb35e058c34ce80ddfb19af042","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v