/api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/3c3a2e4c8244185fc9142396151971b00786d99b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:54:48Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:54:48Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"feat(yuheng): add the LLM gateway module and the approved persistence coordinates\n\nPlan Step 1 of the Yuheng full-MP/LLM/knowledge/wiki plan: register the\nstandalone yuheng-llm-gateway role, give admin and the two shared MCP\nadapters the BOM-managed MyBatis-Plus starter, and let admin reach the\nalready-approved RAG starter. GatewayAiModuleContractTest pins both halves\nof the boundary: the approved module/coordinates exist, and the pure\ncontract/core/runtime-core modules stay free of MyBatis-Plus inheritance.\n\nThe plan asked admin for an explicit Spring AI BOM import; the RAG starter\nalready publishes the PDF and Tika readers and egon-cola-components already\nimports spring-ai-bom, so a second import would create a competing version\nauthority. Dependencies were resolved over the network; no service, database\nor container was started.","tree":{"sha":"d6d18f62c46c9e91ef916456df3717e2898e4bae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/d6d18f62c46c9e91ef916456df3717e2898e4bae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/3c3a2e4c8244185fc9142396151971b00786d99b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/3c3a2e4c8244185fc9142396151971b00786d99b","node_id":"C_kwDOPfC-mdoAKDNjM2EyZTRjODI0NDE4NWZjOTE0MjM5NjE1MTk3MWIwMDc4NmQ5OWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/b79f800feff16b950fcdad3353faa30d6492aca9","sha":"b79f800feff16b950fcdad3353faa30d6492aca9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/b79f800feff16b950fcdad3353faa30d6492aca9"}],"sha":"3c3a2e4c8244185fc9142396151971b00786d99b","url":"https://api.github.co