avadoc was a copy of the\nservice-open one and never stated what Web Open publishes.\n\nAlso recorded what actually drives behaviour, because the previous text\nimplied switches that are inert: Flyway is the live schema path in agent\nwhile managed DDL has no target there; only the Organization group and\nversion are read in service-open, and only the gRPC target and deadline\nin web-open, with the *_FACADE_ENABLED variables bound but read by no\nproduction code. Where a switch is genuinely dead the docs now say so\nrather than documenting it as configuration.\n\nWording only; no generated resource changed beyond the README text, and\n`generate_archetypes.sh check` confirms the set is deterministic.","tree":{"sha":"ab2a6f0aada507ca52fd583627be2f066536ac1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/ab2a6f0aada507ca52fd583627be2f066536ac1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/b79f800feff16b950fcdad3353faa30d6492aca9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starr