itter":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:49:28Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"docs(admin-web): describe the cookie/CSRF session the consoles actually ship\n\nThe Yuheng Admin Web guide still documented an IAM bearer token kept in\nsessionStorage, a \"persist login\" copy to localStorage, and a\nGET /api/v1/yuheng/admin/session endpoint that has never existed, while the\ncode logs in through Tianquan-Shoubing HttpOnly cookies and reads the actor\nfrom /api/v1/auth/bootstrap. Replace that model, name the real Vite and\nstatic-server environment variables, and list the three admin-web packages\nthat consume the shared layer instead of inventing OAuth token-store exports.","tree":{"sha":"8e843b3c401f93be8860f9ccb80921849ecac328","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/8e843b3c401f93be8860f9ccb80921849ecac328"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/b585d24ce8805a735b214c51b8271a95eb649cd3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/rep