OLA/commits/86910ee13db202ab2b022711d18c576bf5f5c93d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:34:52Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:34:52Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"docs(tianquan): correct the token claims and the platform-admin bootstrap CLI\n\nThe Shoubing guide published USER claims the shipped verifier rejects outright\n(`sid`, `client_id`, `token_version`), documented a dead spec path, and listed the\nstarter as reading user state that the stateless-JWT change removed. In Jianshen the\nfirst-administrator procedure named a command, options and jar that no longer exist\nfollowing the rename; replace them with `bootstrap-platform-admin\n--tenant-id --identity-sub` against the exec jar, mirror it into English, and add the\nOAuth Resource boundary section the Chinese guide was missing.","tree":{"sha":"264e056e5821ac87dd00dccceaa2ad1114bf3ae8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/264e056e5821ac87dd00dccceaa2ad1114bf3ae8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/86910ee13db202ab2b022711d18c576bf5f5c93d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/us