om/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/39422ee0669037782165f2f6155e30be0a91252c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:28:16Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:28:16Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"feat(scripts): reclaim stale skill links with --prune\n\nRenaming or dropping a skill here left a dead symlink in every project that\nconsumed it, and discovery reports that as a missing skill with no hint of\nwhere it came from. --prune removes only links whose recorded target sits\nunder this repository''s skill directory and whose name no longer exists, and\ndrops the matching .git/info/exclude bookkeeping along with them; a link the\nproject made to somewhere else is never touched, and pruning stays opt-in so\nthe default run cannot delete anything nobody asked about.","tree":{"sha":"552095174c227aaad22cf813977a1ad9f1370743","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/552095174c227aaad22cf813977a1ad9f1370743"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/39422ee0669037782165f2f6155e30be0a91252c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexand