i.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/b479f4e88808592c6ab3f57cf59c8e5d3c251d47/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:03:58Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:03:58Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"feat(scripts): link the shared coding skills into other repositories\n\nThe egon-coding-* skills are authored here, but consumer repositories kept\ncopied snapshots that rotted silently: SmartReader last touched its copies on\n2026-08-17 while this reactor moved on, and nothing reported the gap.\nlink-skills.sh turns each skill into one symlink inside a target project and\nbooks that path in the target''s .git/info/exclude.\n\nRemoving a real copy is only safe while git can undo it, so untracked or\nlocally modified copies are reported as blocked and need --force, and a\ntarget that is not the root of its own repository is refused outright rather\n than writing into somebody else''s exclude file. test-link-skills.sh pins\nthat boundary along with dry-run, idempotency and the self-link refusal.","tree":{"sha":"22eaa41edba63c3272ce68780033367a91cb61c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/22eaa41edba63c3272ce68780033367a91cb61c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/b479f4e88808592c6ab3f57cf59c8e5d3c251d47","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigne