前端 job 只构建 6 个\n工程中的 3 个、完全不跑测试，后端 job 的 clean test 会静默跳过绑定在 verify\n阶段的架构治理检查。按\"两条足够验证问题\"收敛为：\n\n- ci-backend: 根 reactor clean verify，产出并上传薄 jar 制品（13 个\n  *-exec.jar 胖包约 1.1GB 刻意排除），并打开\n  EGON_OUTBOX_TEST_POSTGRES_ENABLED 让 Testcontainers 的 Outbox 集成测试\n  不再 assume-skip\n- ci-frontend: 6 个前端工程矩阵，每个 npm ci → typecheck → test → build\n  并上传 dist 制品\n\n删除 ci.yaml、ci_java_compatibility.yaml、tianquan-jianshen.yml、\nyuheng.yml；publish-maven-central.yml 保留，它自带 archetype 生成与漂移\n校验，故发布链路不受影响，但 archetype 生成/生成工程/浏览器 e2e 等门禁\n不再在每次 push 时运行。\n\n已知红灯按决定保留，不做 workaround：yuheng-admin-web 与 tianquan-jianshen\n的 package-lock.json 落后于 package.json（shared 0.2.3 对 ^0.2.4）导致\nnpm ci 失败，tianquan-shoubing-admin-web 有 18 个测试失败。","tree":{"sha":"730f3a3eff7cce01f5d27c2d925a0f781d10e4a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/730f3a3eff7cce01f5d27c2d925a0f781d10e4a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/801008df3e28aef066cb6eaec2fdeb6e795a7b9b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/801008df3e28aef066cb6eaec2fdeb6e795a7b9b","node_id":"C_kwDOPfC-mdoAKDgwMTAwOGRmM2UyOGFlZjA2NmNiNmVhZWMyZmRlYjZlNzk1YTdiOWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commit/81f8bed98109eeef4e6bf05d8a8fd97f0fa2d642","sha":"81f8bed98109eeef4e6bf05d8a8fd97f0fa2d642","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/81f8bed98109eeef4e6bf05d8a8fd97f0fa2d642"}],"sha":"801008df3e28aef066cb6eaec2fdeb6e795a7b9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/801008df3e28aef066cb6eaec2fdeb6e795a7b9b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/81f8bed98109eeef4e6bf05d8a8fd97f0fa2d642/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T03:16:34Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T03:16:34Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"fix(scripts): archetype 套件的发布接线断言只针对 Central publish workflow\n\nCI 收敛为 ci-backend + ci-frontend 两条验证流水线后，ci.yaml 与\nci_java_compatibility.yaml 被删除，test-archetype-release.sh 因仍断言\n这两个文件而变红。按新现实收窄，而不是把已删除的门重新引入：\n\n- 两个套件的 workflow 断言只保留 publish-maven-central.yml\n- 删除 fast lane 的 ci.yaml 断言\n- README 记录 archetype 漂移现在只在发布时被兜住，\n  以及 test-generate-archetypes.sh 的接线断言仅 release 模式执行\n\n验证：test-archetype-release 全绿，test-generate-archetypes 的\nunit 与 release 两种模式全绿。","tree":{"sha":"4b9d38f2b962dba01c167e5ae44335331c8cb35d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/4b9d38f2b962dba01c167e5ae44335331c8cb35d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/81f8bed98109eeef4e6bf05d8a8fd97f0fa2d642","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_u