"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/4c9bc73a048f4b705c51daa9dd4977864be848fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T03:06:37Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T03:06:37Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"docs(skill): 规定一次性验收 harness 的落点与收尾处置\n\nscripts/ 顶层曾被 6 个一次性 test-*.sh 占据，且 CI 不跑它们，\n导致断言静默失效。把落点与处置规则写进契约，防止再次堆积：\n\n- writing-plan：新增阻断型规则 22 与质量门禁条目——新写 harness 必须落\n  仓库 scripts/work/，命名为 <plan-id>-<verb>.sh，末个 Step 记录处置\n- plan-template 第 8 章：harness 在 work/ 期间不是 commit path，禁止 force-add\n- executing-plan：最终审核新增第 8 项处置义务与最终报告条目，\n  final-spec-audit 交付纪律补一条未判定即 finding\n- SKILL.md 与 SKILL.zh-CN.md 同步；两个 skill 的\n  test_user_mandated_java_rules / test_validate_manual_checks /\n  test_validate_skill_resources 与 validate_skill_resources 全部通过","tree":{"sha":"a3990d90c234f482b9bc5b85401572362ba124b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/a3990d90c234f482b9bc5b85401572362ba124b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/4c9bc73a048f4b705c51daa9dd4977864be848fa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/All