s/AllenDEricDAlexander/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/commits/ffdaf7979524e0b5b74c0284f3245b4b6ef3b7e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T02:55:47Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T02:55:47Z","email":"mqa010225@gmail.com","name":"mario"},"message":"refactor(scripts): 分层脚本目录并建立 agent 运行时脚本区\n\n一次性验收 harness 长期堆积在 scripts/ 顶层，且 CI 不运行它们，\n导致静默腐化（test-spring-dependency-management.sh 断言的 Boot parent\n前提已被 archetype parent 迁移整体推翻，仍留在树里）。\n\n- checks/：3 个纯静态不变量守卫，--root 默认改为上两级\n- regression/：4 个顶层工具的回归套件，仓库根解析改为 ../..，\n  GENERATOR 改指 ${REPO_ROOT}/scripts/generate_archetypes.sh\n- work/：agent 运行时脚本唯一落点，gitignore 只留 .gitkeep\n- 删除 3 个已失效或一次性的 harness，git 历史即归档\n- README.md 记录分层判断表、引用方与 work/ 收尾三选一规则\n- 忽略 __pycache__","tree":{"sha":"012ff924753c6c80233a3bcbd2fd03fe491be5d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/trees/012ff924753c6c80233a3bcbd2fd03fe491be5d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllenDEricDAlexander/Egon-COLA/git/commits/ffdaf7979524e0b5b74c0284f3245b4b6ef3b7e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81850967?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDEricDAlexander","id":81850967,"login":"AllenDEricDAlexander","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODUwOTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDEricDAlexander/orgs",