 React components: AIAssistantChat, AIAssistantButton, AICommandPalette\n- API routes for chat, conversations, feedback, suggestions\n\nPhase 2 - No-Code Portal Builder:\n- PageBuilder with drag-and-drop visual editing\n- WidgetLibrary with 35+ widget types across categories\n- WidgetRenderer, SortableWidget for widget display\n- WidgetConfigPanel, PageSettingsPanel for configuration\n- BuilderToolbar with viewport controls and zoom\n- FormBuilder for self-service action forms\n- TemplateGallery with pre-built page templates\n- API routes for pages, templates, widgets, export/import\n\nPhase 3 - Service Health Scorecards (Spotify Soundcheck):\n- Comprehensive scorecard types and interfaces\n- ScorecardService with evaluation and caching\n- RuleEngine supporting metadata, annotations, API, GitHub,\n  SonarQube, Snyk, PagerDuty, Datadog, Prometheus rules\n- Default health scorecard with security, reliability, quality,\n  documentation, operations, observability checks\n- Bronze/Silver/Gold/Platinum level system\n- ScorecardCard and ScorecardDetails React components\n- API routes for scorecards and evaluation","tree":{"sha":"7bb7470808d5a70af3eb1b5007164f9edbf6ba9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asklokesh/NEXT-Portal/git/trees/7bb7470808d5a70af3eb1b5007164f9edbf6ba9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asklokesh/NEXT-Portal/git/commits/b7a8f7623561e63ae41b063a1b9a65f0ace5e55a","verification":{"payload":"tree 7bb7470808d5a70af3eb1b5007164f9edbf6ba9c\nparent 48dc6cf1b72372a12e573cb53aed9918483447df\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1764609233 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1764609233 +0000\n\nfeat: Add AI Knowledge Assistant, No-Code Builder, and Service Scorecards\n\nPhase 1 - AI Knowledge Assistant (Spotify AiKA competitor):\n- AiKnowledgeAssistant service with RAG pipeline\n- AIToolRegistry with catalog, docs, deployment, monitoring tools\n- MCPClient for Model Context Protocol integration\n- AIAnalytics for usage tracking and knowledge gaps\n- React components: AIAssistantChat, AIAssistantButton, AICommandPalette\n- API routes for chat, conversations, feedback, suggestions\n\nPhase 2 - No-Code Portal Builder:\n- PageBuilder with drag-and-drop visual editing\n- WidgetLibrary with 35+ widget types across categories\n- WidgetRenderer, SortableWidget for widget display\n- WidgetConfigPanel, PageSettingsPanel for configuration\n- BuilderToolbar with viewport controls and zoom\n- FormBuilder for self-service action forms\n- TemplateGallery with pre-built page templates\n- API routes for pages, templates, widgets, export/import\n\nPhase 3 - Service Health Scorecards (Spotify Soundcheck):\n- Comprehensive scorecard types and interfaces\n- ScorecardService with evaluation and caching\n- RuleEngine supporting metadata, annotations, API, GitHub,\n  SonarQube, Snyk, PagerDuty, Datadog, Prometheus rules\n- Default health scorecard with security, reliability, quality,\n  documentation, operations, observability checks\n- Bronze/Silver/Gold/Platinum level system\n- ScorecardCard and ScorecardDetails React components\n- API routes for scorecards and evaluation\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLEBGZ6U\nIxfW/lsbDh23vZ/D6+QTQXwnoiGltPHbAIak8TmO2cxk36mtR2xr1eY5wnTdI/iXqrXgfAjSqtAn\ngQQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-12-01T17:14:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_u