i@student.42.fr","name":"Lazare Rossillon"},"message":"debug: add comprehensive timing analysis for network re-attribution\n\nAdd detailed console logs to diagnose missing words in network mode:\n- Compare time ranges between network segments and payload words\n- Identify gaps between consecutive network segments\n- Show examples of unmatched words with absolute timestamps\n- Display relative time offsets for easier debugging\n\nThis will help identify if words are missing due to:\n- Network segments not covering full meeting duration\n- Gaps where no speaker is marked as speaking\n- Timestamp alignment issues\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4bc9a9c889a9efa8cd762857e296643dec50f2e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Meeting-BaaS/frontend/git/trees/4bc9a9c889a9efa8cd762857e296643dec50f2e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Meeting-BaaS/frontend/git/commits/524af4523799772414e7806944ba380beffa606e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27212276?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazare-42/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazare-42/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazare-42/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazare-42/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Lazare-42","id":27212276,"login":"Lazare-42","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjEyMjc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazare-42/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazare-42/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazare-42/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazare-42/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazare-42/subscriptions