0-08T20:06:54.073Z","repositoryId":1040276198,"sha":"b08b93ba3010b1fcd0814d63f64be8ea91b9a7d4"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T20:06:54.073Z","raw":[{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/36f8868e1ae2d3b94b0341a0f7a478b61eaf8d17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-27T17:00:50Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-27T17:00:50Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"feat: Add Clear Filters button and fix E2E test 02.07\n\n- Add Clear Filters button to EmployeesPage.jsx with FilterListOff icon\n- Add clearAllFilters function to reset all filter states\n- Add data-testid=\"clear-filters-button\" for reliable test selection\n- Update clearFilters helper to use getByTestId with fallback\n- Fix test 02.07 to destructure page and verify filters before clearing\n\nAll 29 E2E tests now pass (100%)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1a31bcf3e71570bfff576836b4497105f8c6075d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/1a31bcf3e71570bfff576836b4497105f8c6075d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/36f8868e1ae2d3b94b0341a0f7a478b61eaf8d17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/36f8868e1ae2d3b94b0341a0f7a478b61eaf8d17","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDM2Zjg4NjhlMWFlMmQzYjk0YjAzNDFhMGY3YTQ3OGI2MWVhZjhkMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/fc01636d2cc50d7c8274d171876613366c19df76","sha":"fc01636d2cc50d7c8274d171876613366c19df76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/fc01636d2cc50d7c8274d171876613366c19df76"}],"sha":"36f8868e1ae2d3b94b0341a0f7a478b61eaf8d17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/36f8868e1ae2d3b94b0341a0f7a478b61eaf8d17"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/fc01636d2cc50d7c8274d171876613366c19df76/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-27T04:00:04Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-27T04:00:04Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Multiple E2E test fixes - 28/29 tests now passing (97%)\n\nBackend fixes:\n- Fix test cleanup FK violation by deleting user_roles first\n- Add safe role property accessor to handle unloaded relationships\n- Eagerly load roles in employee update service\n\nE2E test fixes:\n- Fix phone number validation (use valid US format +12125550xxx)\n- Fix test 05.03 to check for Access Denied page instead of list\n- Disable auto-open for Playwright HTML reporter\n\nProgress: 28/29 tests passing (up from 15/29 initial)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cc6512a35d73ec22c81742d6c6481ed82d8ce1fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/cc6512a35d73ec22c81742d6c6481ed82d8ce1fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/fc01636d2cc50d7c8274d171876613366c19df76","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/fc01636d2cc50d7c8274d171876613366c19df76","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKGZjMDE2MzZkMmNjNTBkN2M4Mjc0ZDE3MTg3NjYxMzM2NmMxOWRmNzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/529f656f7934c81416893fd432508b5145075719","sha":"529f656f7934c81416893fd432508b5145075719","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/529f656f7934c81416893fd432508b5145075719"}],"sha":"fc01636d2cc50d7c8274d171876613366c19df76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/fc01636d2cc50d7c8274d171876613366c19df76"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/529f656f7934c81416893fd432508b5145075719/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-27T03:19:42Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-27T03:19:42Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Fix filter dropdown frontend bug for tests 02.06 and 02.07\n\n**Root Cause Analysis:**\n1. Frontend: roles/departments arrays not memoized, causing re-render issues\n2. Backend: User model missing ''role'' property for frontend compatibility\n3. Backend: Employee creation endpoint not assigning roles to users\n\n**Changes Made:**\n1. Frontend (EmployeesPage.jsx):\n   - Added useMemo import\n   - Wrapped departments and roles arrays in useMemo with employees dependency\n   - Ensures filter dropdowns re-render when employees state changes\n\n2. Backend (User model):\n   - Added @property role to return primary role name as string\n   - Implements priority-based role selection (admin > manager > employee > guest)\n   - Enables Pydantic serialization to EmployeeResponse.role field\n\n3. Backend (employee creation endpoint):\n   - Added role assignment after user creation and commit\n   - Loads user with roles relationship using selectinload\n   - Creates RoleChangeHistory audit trail for initial role assignment\n   - Reloads user to ensure fresh role data in response\n\n**Test Results:**\n- Test 02.06 (Should filter employees by role): ✅ PASSING\n- Test 02.07 (Should clear all filters): Still investigating\n\n**Files Modified:**\n- frontend/src/pages/EmployeesPage.jsx\n- backend/src/auth/models.py\n- backend/src/api/employees.py\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1994c06ee5f39b6dbcecba6b27f12f695b4bb1f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/1994c06ee5f39b6dbcecba6b27f12f695b4bb1f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/529f656f7934c81416893fd432508b5145075719","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/529f656f7934c81416893fd432508b5145075719","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDUyOWY2NTZmNzkzNGM4MTQxNjg5M2ZkNDMyNTA4YjUxNDUwNzU3MTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/ff098caeb88749dab8e144e6224feae09b1590d4","sha":"ff098caeb88749dab8e144e6224feae09b1590d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/ff098caeb88749dab8e144e6224feae09b1590d4"}],"sha":"529f656f7934c81416893fd432508b5145075719","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/529f656f7934c81416893fd432508b5145075719"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/ff098caeb88749dab8e144e6224feae09b1590d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-27T03:14:41Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-27T03:14:41Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Correct delete menu item selectors in employee deletion tests\n\n- Fixed tests 04.02 and 04.03 to use ''delete employee'' instead of ''delete'' when calling selectMenuAction()\n- Menu item text is ''Delete Employee'', not just ''Delete'', so the selector needs to match\n- Modified deleteEmployee helper to accept waitForSuccess parameter for better test flexibility\n- Added unique timestamps to test emails to prevent test pollution\n- Added additional wait time in test 04.01 to help with backend persistence timing\n\nTests 04.02 and 04.03 now pass reliably (100% success rate).\nTest 04.01 shows improved stability (80%+ success rate) but may need backend investigation for remaining flakiness.","tree":{"sha":"6cbd8f6c80bcae55bcc9b329201fb3c25fc39244","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/6cbd8f6c80bcae55bcc9b329201fb3c25fc39244"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/ff098caeb88749dab8e144e6224feae09b1590d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/ff098caeb88749dab8e144e6224feae09b1590d4","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKGZmMDk4Y2FlYjg4NzQ5ZGFiOGUxNDRlNjIyNGZlYWUwOWIxNTkwZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/3989a65bf8b8a9675eb3818895e88b2877dba980","sha":"3989a65bf8b8a9675eb3818895e88b2877dba980","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/3989a65bf8b8a9675eb3818895e88b2877dba980"}],"sha":"ff098caeb88749dab8e144e6224feae09b1590d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/ff098caeb88749dab8e144e6224feae09b1590d4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/3989a65bf8b8a9675eb3818895e88b2877dba980/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-27T01:34:36Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-27T01:34:36Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Use correct Playwright locator syntax for data-testid\n\nChanged from non-existent get