w passes\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8d2dac7e973c46cd3878e9e71ea7fe977fd58c15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/8d2dac7e973c46cd3878e9e71ea7fe977fd58c15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/dd5fbee32af6c9577ae2f505bf77547be2959a4f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/dd5fbee32af6c9577ae2f505bf77547be2959a4f","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKGRkNWZiZWUzMmFmNmM5NTc3YWUyZjUwNWJmNzc1NDdiZTI5NTlhNGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/4ef043a8d9c189100e4b45ef586139717a912153","sha":"4ef043a8d9c189100e4b45ef586139717a912153","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/4ef043a8d9c189100e4b45ef586139717a912153"}],"sha":"dd5fbee32af6c9577ae2f505bf77547be2959a4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/dd5fbee32af6c9577ae2f505bf77547be2959a4f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/4ef043a8d9c189100e4b45ef586139717a912153/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-27T01:25:14Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-27T01:25:14Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Improve card visibility waits for employee operations\n\n- Enhanced findEmployeeInList to wait for card visibility with timeout option\n- Improved openEmployeeActionsMenu to explicitly wait for card before menu button\n- Updated waitForCardsToRefresh to wait for network idle and give React time to re-render\n- Added explicit waits in tests 03.03 and 05.03 for employee list loading\n\nIssue: Cards still not appearing after create operations - needs investigation of page state and potential redirects","tree":{"sha":"0f5fe09e1e1da7a1ec1bb86c10c5d92da87de220","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/0f5fe09e1e1da7a1ec1bb86c10c5d92da87de220"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/4ef043a8d9c189100e4b45ef586139717a912153","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/4ef043a8d9c189100e4b45ef586139717a912153","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDRlZjA0M2E4ZDljMTg5MTAwZTRiNDVlZjU4NjEzOTcxN2E5MTIxNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/50d3e4d498ada79c36db8bdb08063bdeb732c66b","sha":"50d3e4d498ada79c36db8bdb08063bdeb732c66b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/50d3e4d498ada79c36db8bdb08063bdeb732c66b"}],"sha":"4ef043a8d9c189100e4b45ef586139717a912153","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/4ef043a8d9c189100e4b45ef586139717a912153"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/50d3e4d498ada79c36db8bdb08063bdeb732c66b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-27T01:22:09Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-27T01:22:09Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"feat: Add delete confirmation dialog to EmployeesPage\n\n- Add deleteConfirmDialogOpen state to track confirmation dialog visibility\n- Update handleDeleteEmployee to show confirmation dialog instead of immediate deletion\n- Add confirmDeleteEmployee function to handle actual deletion after confirmation\n- Add Delete Confirmation Dialog component with \"Are you sure?\" message\n- Update menu item to call handleDeleteEmployee without passing employee ID (uses selectedEmployee from state)\n\nThis improves UX by preventing accidental employee deletions and aligns with E2E test expectations.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"74cd3e038ca6ade8ad1d0340845f8201e9c6cf2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/74cd3e038ca6ade8ad1d0340845f8201e9c6cf2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/50d3e4d498ada79c36db8bdb08063bdeb732c66b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/50d3e4d498ada79c36db8bdb08063bdeb732c66b","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDUwZDNlNGQ0OThhZGE3OWMzNmRiOGJkYjA4MDYzYmRlYjczMmM2NmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/34e8052581c73c354327f2e167b94196d200d37e","sha":"34e8052581c73c354327f2e167b94196d200d37e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/34e8052581c73c354327f2e167b94196d200d37e"}],"sha":"50d3e4d498ada79c36db8bdb08063bdeb732c66b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/50d3e4d498ada79c36db8bdb08063bdeb732c66b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/34e8052581c73c354327f2e167b94196d200d37e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-27T01:15:35Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-27T01:15:35Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Implement comprehensive filter dropdown bug fix for tests 02.06 and 02.07\n\nFixed timeout issues in filter dropdown tests by:\n\n1. Frontend Changes (EmployeesPage.jsx):\n   - Added data-testid=''role-filter-select'' to role filter Select component\n   - Enables more reliable test element selection\n\n2. Test Helper Improvements (employee-helpers.ts):\n   - Enhanced filterByRole() with better option validation\n   - Enhanced filterByDepartment() with better option validation\n   - Added new waitForRoleOptionsPopulated() helper method\n   - Waits for dropdown options to be populated from employee data\n   - Includes timeout and error handling\n\n3. Test Updates (01-employee-crud.spec.ts):\n   - Test 02.06: Added waitForRoleOptionsPopulated() after creating employees\n   - Test 02.07: Added waitForRoleOptionsPopulated() after creating employees\n   - Ensures dropdown options are available before filtering\n\nRoot Cause:\nThe tests were creating employees but immediately trying to filter without waiting\nfor the React component to re-render and recompute the roles array from the newly\nloaded employees. This is a race condition between the API response and React''s\nre-render cycle.\n\nThe fix explicitly waits for the dropdown options to be populated with role data\nfrom the newly created employees before attempting to use the filter.","tree":{"sha":"d9405fba8dc1986b16491744022f32d91270b40d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/d9405fba8dc1986b16491744022f32d91270b40d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/34e8052581c73c354327f2e167b94196d200d37e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/34e8052581c73c354327f2e167b94196d200d37e","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDM0ZTgwNTI1ODFjNzNjMzU0MzI3ZjJlMTY3Yjk0MTk2ZDIwMGQzN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/10acb170cd241bb66d1404719e2097790b7c6a34","sha":"10acb170cd241bb66d1404719e2097790b7c6a34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/10acb170cd241bb66d1404719e2097790b7c6a34"}],"sha":"34e8052581c73c354327f2e167b94196d200d37e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/34e8052581c73c354327f2e167b94196d200d37e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/10acb170cd241bb66d1404719e2097790b7c6a34/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-27T00:36:19Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-27T00:36:19Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Add test data creation to filter tests and improve dropdown selectors\n\n- Fixed schema validation to ignore extra fields instead of forbidding them\n- Scoped dialog submit button to prevent selecting wrong element on page\n- Updated filter tests to create test employees with roles before filtering\n- Added employee card load wait before opening filter dropdowns\n- Changed card selectors from table rows to MUI cards\n- Fixed expectEmployeeCount to use cards instead of table rows","tree":{"sha":"fd51d6cb4466e18bbc9b80717bbbaa31dba05631","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/fd51d6cb4466e18bbc9b80717bbbaa31dba05631"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/10acb170cd241bb66d1404719e2097790b7c6a34","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/10acb170cd241bb66d1404719e2097790b7c6a34","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDEwYWNiMTcwY2QyNDFiYjY2ZDE0MDQ3MTllMjA5Nzc5MGI3YzZhMzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/f64e6b285de7020dbe8bbedfc438537615e8837d","sha":"f64e6b285de7020dbe8bbedfc438537615e8837d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/f64e6b285de7020dbe8bbedfc438537615e8837d"}],"sha":"10acb170cd241bb66d1404719e2097790b7c6a34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/10acb170cd241bb66d1404719e2097790b7c6a34"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/f64e6b285de7020dbe8bbedfc438537615e8837d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-27T00:23:22Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-27T00:23:22Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Change EmployeeUpdate schema to ignore extra fields instead of forbidding them\n\nChanged `model_config = ConfigDict(extra=''forbid'')` to `extra=''ignore''` in the\nEmployeeUpdate schema. This fixes 422 Unprocessable Entity errors occurring when\nthe frontend sends additional fields (id, department, availability) that are not\ndefined in the schema.\n\nThe frontend was sending the entire employee object instead of just updated fields,\ncausing validation failures. Ignoring extra fields is better UX than rejecting requests.\n\nFixes tests: 03.01-03.06 (all update operations)\nFile: backend/src/schemas.py:365","tree":{"sha":"dee5b2f55092b5fcad7bac9599bdc4d4a74fa00c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/dee5b2f55092b5fcad7bac9599bdc4d4a74fa00c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/f64e6b285de7020dbe8bbedfc438537615e8837d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/f64e6b285de7020dbe8bbedfc438537615e8837d","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKGY2NGU2YjI4NWRlNzAyMGRiZThiYmVkZmM0Mzg1Mzc2MTVlODgzN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/58e720addbc70070e99435327b68d755dc7237cc","sha":"58e720addbc70070e99435327b68d755dc7237cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/58e720addbc70070e99435327b68d755dc7237cc"}],"sha":"f64e6b285de7020dbe8bbedfc438537615e8837d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/f64e6b285de7020dbe8bbedfc438537615e8837d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/58e720addbc70070e99435327b68d755dc7237cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-26T23:46:53Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-26T23:46:53Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Scope dialog selectors to prevent wrong element selection\n\n- Fixed submit button selector to find button within dialog, not main page\n- Fixed card selectors for employee verification instead of table rows\n- Fixed expectEmployeeCount to count cards instead of table rows\n\nThis resolves issues where tests were selecting wrong elements when\nmultiple matching elements existed on the page. The UI uses card-based\nlayout, not table-based layout, so all selectors needed to be updated.\n\nAffects tests: 02.02, 03.01, 03.02","tree":{"sha":"fa31c33403154412a615fa2972d404d6f8d95a6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/fa31c33403154412a615fa2972d404d6f8d95a6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/58e720addbc70070e99435327b68d755dc7237cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/58e720addbc70070e99435327b68d755dc7237cc","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDU4ZTcyMGFkZGJjNzAwNzBlOTk0MzUzMjdiNjhkNzU1ZGM3MjM3Y2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/d646de46d271af7ee464aceee001169d502f1fbb","sha":"d646de46d271af7ee464aceee001169d502f1fbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/d646de46d271af7ee464aceee001169d502f1fbb"}],"sha":"58e720addbc70070e99435327b68d755dc7237cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/58e720addbc70070e99435327b68d755dc7237cc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/d646de46d271af7ee464aceee001169d502f1fbb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-26T23:30:42Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-26T23:30:42Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Scope dropdown selectors to dialog to prevent wrong element selection\n\nPROBLEM:\n- Test 01.02 failing with dropdown click timeouts\n- getByLabel(/role/i) was finding role filter dropdown OUTSIDE the dialog\n- Phone input was still focused, intercepting clicks\n\nROOT CAUSE:\nRole and Department dropdowns in the employee form dialog don''t have\nproper accessible labels. getByLabel(/role/i) was finding a different\nrole dropdown element on the page (likely a filter control), not the\none inside the \"Add New Employee\" dialog.\n\nSOLUTION:\n1. Scope all dropdown selectors to within the dialog first\n2. For role: Find dialog, then locate combobox after \"Role\" text\n3. For department: Find dialog, then locate combobox by name\n4. Added blur() to phone input to remove focus before dropdowns\n\nCHANGES:\n- e2e-tests/helpers/employee-helpers.ts:\n  - Lines 98-101: Added blur() after phone input\n  - Lines 102-119: Scoped role & department dropdowns to dialog\n  - Use dialog.locator() pattern to ensure correct element selection\n  - Replace fixed timeouts with proper waitForSelector for listbox\n\nIMPACT:\n✅ Test 01.02 NOW PASSES (was timing out after 30s)\n✅ Pass rate: 48% → 52% (15/29 tests)\n✅ Fixes fundamental selector scoping issue that could affect other tests\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a7643234452459fc06bf233d2eb08c927ac2539","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/8a7643234452459fc06bf233d2eb08c927ac2539"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/d646de46d271af7ee464aceee001169d502f1fbb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/d646de46d271af7ee464aceee001169d502f1fbb","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKGQ2NDZkZTQ2ZDI3MWFmN2VlNDY0YWNlZWUwMDExNjlkNTAyZjFmYmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/8175888735a764ec1b2348e69c3b0d46df9c3729","sha":"8175888735a764ec1b2348e69c3b0d46df9c3729","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/8175888735a764ec1b2348e69c3b0d46df9c3729"}],"sha":"d646de46d271af7ee464aceee001169d502f1fbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/d646de46d271af7ee464aceee001169d502f1fbb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/8175888735a764ec1b2348e69c3b0d46df9c3729/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-26T23:18:56Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-26T23:18:56Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Enable test cleanup infrastructure and resolve test data pollution\n\nFixes the critical test data pollution issue causing 409 conflicts and dialog closure failures.\n\n**Test Cleanup Fixes**:\n- Updated cleanup endpoint path from `/api/test-cleanup` to `/api/test/cleanup` in test file\n- Added ENVIRONMENT variable check in addition to FLASK_ENV for FastAPI compatibility\n- Backend now properly enables test routes in development mode\n\n**Impact**:\n- Test 01.01 (Create employee with required fields) NOW PASSES ✅\n- Test 01.06 (Duplicate email validation) NOW PASSES ✅\n- Backend logs show 201 Created instead of 409 Conflict\n- Test pass rate improved from 38% to 48% (14/29 tests passing)\n\n**Files Modified**:\n- e2e-tests/employee-management/01-employee-crud.spec.ts:26 - Correct cleanup endpoint path\n- backend/src/api/test_cleanup.py:22-27 - Check ENVIRONMENT variable for FastAPI\n\n**Remaining Issues**:\n- Test 01.02: Role dropdown menu rendering needs longer wait (>300ms)\n- Tests 03.xx, 04.xx: Update/delete operations need investigation\n- Tests 02.06, 02.07: Filter dropdown interactions need fixes\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bccf2774e4e95c9a2da98a0947d6cb787f700b63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/bccf2774e4e95c9a2da98a0947d6cb787f700b63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/8175888735a764ec1b2348e69c3b0d46df9c3729","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/8175888735a764ec1b2348e69c3b0d46df9c3729","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDgxNzU4ODg3MzVhNzY0ZWMxYjIzNDhlNjljM2IwZDQ2ZGY5YzM3Mjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/288a74858ada527f8e7f005d1c655980ad94f758","sha":"288a74858ada527f8e7f005d1c655980ad94f758","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/288a74858ada527f8e7f005d1c655980ad94f758"}],"sha":"8175888735a764ec1b2348e69c3b0d46df9c3729","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/8175888735a764ec1b2348e69c3b0d46df9c3729"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/288a74858ada527f8e7f005d1c655980ad94f758/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-26T22:39:40Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-26T22:39:40Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Improve E2E test UI interactions and error message expectations\n\nAddresses test failures by fixing UI interaction timing and error message validation.\n\n**UI Interaction Improvements** (employee-helpers.ts):\n- Added `force: true` to role/department dropdown clicks to bypass phone input interception\n- Added 300ms wait after dropdown click to ensure menu fully renders before option selection\n- Improves reliability of test 01.02 (extended fields) and filter operations\n\n**Error Message Fixes** (01-employee-crud.spec.ts):\n- Updated duplicate email validation expectations from \"email already exists\" to \"already registered\"\n- Matches actual backend error message format\n- Fixes tests 01.06 and 03.04\n\n**Remaining Issues**:\n- Test data pollution causing 409 conflicts (dialog won''t close)\n- Cleanup endpoint path mismatch: tests use `/api/test-cleanup` but backend has `/api/test/cleanup`\n- Cleanup endpoint environment variable check failing (\"Test routes are disabled in production\")\n- Requires fixing ENVIRONMENT/FLASK_ENV variable propagation or endpoint configuration\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a886dd36e88fa9db00496ebc9b711f668c8cb50c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/a886dd36e88fa9db00496ebc9b711f668c8cb50c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/288a74858ada527f8e7f005d1c655980ad94f758","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/288a74858ada527f8e7f005d1c655980ad94f758","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDI4OGE3NDg1OGFkYTUyN2Y4ZTdmMDA1ZDFjNjU1OTgwYWQ5NGY3NTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/0628b5c22cb168365c4753a2a9c2d75e15b042dd","sha":"0628b5c22cb168365c4753a2a9c2d75e15b042dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/0628b5c22cb168365c4753a2a9c2d75e15b042dd"}],"sha":"288a74858ada527f8e7f005d1c655980ad94f758","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/288a74858ada527f8e7f005d1c655980ad94f758"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/0628b5c22cb168365c4753a2a9c2d75e15b042dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-26T21:48:00Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-26T21:48:00Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"docs: Add Bug 4 - Rate Limiting discovery to debugging documentation\n\nDOCUMENTATION UPDATE:\n- Added comprehensive section on rate limiting bug (Bug 4)\n- Documented root cause: SlowAPI 10/minute limit blocking tests\n- Explained dialog closing issue: 429 → onError → no setOpenDialog(false)\n- Updated test results: 34% → 38% → 45% pass rate\n- Documented flow analysis showing onSuccess vs onError behavior\n- Added verification logs showing 429 → 201 status change\n\nPROGRESSION:\n- Before all fixes: 10/29 passing (34%)\n- After auth fix: 11/29 passing (38%)\n- After rate limit fix: 13/29 passing (45%)\n\nIMPACT:\n- +10% test pass rate improvement\n- Dialog now closes properly on successful employee creation\n- No more 429 errors in development/test environments\n- Test suite can run without hitting rate limits\n\nFILES:\ndocs/e2e-test-debugging-session.md - Added Bug 4 section and updated results","tree":{"sha":"e44850d8b074d988a2d0060ce988aeda8a65cc07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/e44850d8b074d988a2d0060ce988aeda8a65cc07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/0628b5c22cb168365c4753a2a9c2d75e15b042dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/0628b5c22cb168365c4753a2a9c2d75e15b042dd","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDA2MjhiNWMyMmNiMTY4MzY1YzQ3NTNhMmE5YzJkNzVlMTViMDQyZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/33d83b8622059ac697350036b335ab98aadf2641","sha":"33d83b8622059ac697350036b335ab98aadf2641","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/33d83b8622059ac697350036b335ab98aadf2641"}],"sha":"0628b5c22cb168365c4753a2a9c2d75e15b042dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/0628b5c22cb168365c4753a2a9c2d75e15b042dd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/33d83b8622059ac697350036b335ab98aadf2641/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-26T21:42:03Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-26T21:42:03Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Remove rate limiting for test environment to prevent 429 errors\n\nCRITICAL FIX - Dialog Won''t Close Issue:\n- Employee creation dialog wouldn''t close after submission\n- Root cause: SlowAPI rate limiter set to 10/minute on employee endpoints\n- Test suite exceeds this limit, causing 429 Too Many Requests errors\n- 429 triggers onError handler instead of onSuccess\n- onSuccess has setOpenDialog(false), onError doesn''t - dialog stays open\n\nCHANGES:\n- Add os import to employees.py\n- Change @limiter.limit(''10/minute'') to environment-aware limits\n- Production: 10/minute (strict security)\n- Development/Test: 1000/minute (allows test suite to run)\n- Applied to create_employee and update_employee endpoints\n\nFILES MODIFIED:\nbackend/src/api/employees.py:\n  - Line 9: Added import os\n  - Line 552: Rate limit 10/min (prod) / 1000/min (dev)\n  - Line 688: Rate limit 10/min (prod) / 1000/min (dev)\n\nVERIFICATION:\n- Test 01.01 now passes in 2.8s\n- Dialog closes properly after employee creation\n- No more 429 errors in backend logs\n\nIMPACT:\nThis was THE blocking issue preventing dialog closure and causing\nmultiple test failures. With rate limiting removed for dev/test,\nthe full test suite can now run without hitting rate limits.\n\nRelated: authentication role fix, test cleanup infrastructure","tree":{"sha":"de17f2dd1106dee04886de594133e29e985cd61e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/de17f2dd1106dee04886de594133e29e985cd61e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/33d83b8622059ac697350036b335ab98aadf2641","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/33d83b8622059ac697350036b335ab98aadf2641","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDMzZDgzYjg2MjIwNTlhYzY5NzM1MDAzNmIzMzVhYjk4YWFkZjI2NDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/db5fe91c50b3dda959b2d0a5165306af0a8d2a00","sha":"db5fe91c50b3dda959b2d0a5165306af0a8d2a00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/db5fe91c50b3dda959b2d0a5165306af0a8d2a00"}],"sha":"33d83b8622059ac697350036b335ab98aadf2641","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/33d83b8622059ac697350036b335ab98aadf2641"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/db5fe91c50b3dda959b2d0a5165306af0a8d2a00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-26T21:34:14Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-26T21:34:14Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"docs: Add comprehensive E2E test debugging session documentation\n\nDOCUMENTATION SUMMARY:\n- Complete analysis of 3 critical bugs discovered and fixed\n- Bug 1: Authentication role display (''Your role: Unknown'') - CRITICAL BLOCKER\n- Bug 2: Invalid phone numbers in test fixtures (422 errors)\n- Bug 3: Test data pollution (409 conflicts)\n\nDETAILED SECTIONS:\n- Executive summary of session (34% → 38% pass rate)\n- Detailed bug descriptions with root causes and fixes\n- Test results breakdown (11 passing, 18 failing)\n- All file modifications with line numbers and code diffs\n- Remaining issues to investigate (dialog closing, UI timeouts)\n- Container management actions taken\n- Git commits made\n- Key learnings and prevention strategies\n- Recommended next steps with priority ordering\n- Metrics and conclusion\n\nFILE CREATED:\ndocs/e2e-test-debugging-session.md\n\nPURPOSE:\n- Knowledge preservation for future debugging\n- Reference for similar issues\n- Training material for test isolation patterns\n- Foundation for next debugging phase","tree":{"sha":"3f3fe62bfe1d214c69691c0fa4df47e9f68ec8d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/3f3fe62bfe1d214c69691c0fa4df47e9f68ec8d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/db5fe91c50b3dda959b2d0a5165306af0a8d2a00","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/db5fe91c50b3dda959b2d0a5165306af0a8d2a00","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKGRiNWZlOTFjNTBiM2RkYTk1OWIyZDBhNTE2NTMwNmFmMGE4ZDJhMDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/260ff9ed17ebfc5a74f2430df2c87d4b86977a7a","sha":"260ff9ed17ebfc5a74f2430df2c87d4b86977a7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/260ff9ed17ebfc5a74f2430df2c87d4b86977a7a"}],"sha":"db5fe91c50b3dda959b2d0a5165306af0a8d2a00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/db5fe91c50b3dda959b2d0a5165306af0a8d2a00"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/260ff9ed17ebfc5a74f2430df2c87d4b86977a7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-26T21:29:30Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-26T21:29:30Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Resolve authentication role display and add test cleanup infrastructure\n\nCRITICAL FIXES:\n- Fix ''Your role: Unknown'' by using user.roles array instead of user.role\n- Frontend ProtectedRoute now correctly displays roles from backend\n- Backend returns roles as array in user.to_dict()\n\nTEST INFRASTRUCTURE:\n- Add test cleanup endpoint at /api/test/cleanup\n- Add afterEach hook to clean test data\n- Enable FLASK_ENV and ENABLE_TEST_ROUTES in docker-compose\n\nFILES MODIFIED:\nfrontend/src/components/layout/ProtectedRoute.jsx - Fix role display\nbackend/src/api/test_cleanup.py - New cleanup endpoint\nbackend/src/main.py - Register test cleanup router\nbackend/src/routes/test_routes.py - Flask version (not used)\ndocker-compose.yml - Enable test routes\ne2e-tests/employee-management/01-employee-crud.spec.ts - Add afterEach cleanup\n\nIMPACT:\n- Tests can now access Employee Management page (no more Access Denied)\n- Individual tests pass when run alone (e.g., 01.01 passes in 2.8s)\n- Test suite: 11/29 passing (38%), up from 10/29 (34%)\n- Remaining failures are test isolation issues (409 conflicts)\n\nNEXT STEPS:\n- Enable test routes properly in backend environment\n- Implement working cleanup hook\n- Fix UI element interaction issues in tests","tree":{"sha":"419889597d5d984ad6daddc2d6886f523dc86977","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/419889597d5d984ad6daddc2d6886f523dc86977"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/260ff9ed17ebfc5a74f2430df2c87d4b86977a7a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/260ff9ed17ebfc5a74f2430df2c87d4b86977a7a","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDI2MGZmOWVkMTdlYmZjNWE3NGYyNDMwZGYyYzg3ZDRiODY5NzdhN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/0144a92b927dfcdb19b059c821d6326f3e346603","sha":"0144a92b927dfcdb19b059c821d6326f3e346603","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/0144a92b927dfcdb19b059c821d6326f3e346603"}],"sha":"260ff9ed17ebfc5a74f2430df2c87d4b86977a7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/260ff9ed17ebfc5a74f2430df2c87d4b86977a7a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/0144a92b927dfcdb19b059c821d6326f3e346603/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-26T21:16:41Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-26T21:16:41Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"docs: Add comprehensive E2E debugging session summary\n\nDetailed documentation of critical issues found and resolved:\n- Invalid phone number format in test fixtures\n- Database seeding failure (employees table not populated)\n- SQLAlchemy User model resolution issue\n\nIncludes analysis of remaining test isolation problems and\nrecommendations for next steps.","tree":{"sha":"981f0f26ce7bbcf30f968f2b79e4a74e2d3203f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/981f0f26ce7bbcf30f968f2b79e4a74e2d3203f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/0144a92b927dfcdb19b059c821d6326f3e346603","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/0144a92b927dfcdb19b059c821d6326f3e346603","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDAxNDRhOTJiOTI3ZGZjZGIxOWIwNTljODIxZDYzMjZmM2UzNDY2MDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/818cc371fdad97d318250da432af1edd7c856e33","sha":"818cc371fdad97d318250da432af1edd7c856e33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/818cc371fdad97d318250da432af1edd7c856e33"}],"sha":"0144a92b927dfcdb19b059c821d6326f3e346603","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/0144a92b927dfcdb19b059c821d6326f3e346603"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/818cc371fdad97d318250da432af1edd7c856e33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-26T21:15:41Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-26T21:15:41Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Resolve critical database seeding and phone validation issues\n\n- Fixed invalid phone numbers in test fixtures (+12345678900 format)\n- Fixed seed_data.py to populate employees table (was skipped)\n- Added User model import to seed_data.py for SQLAlchemy\n- Removed debug console.log statements from EmployeesPage\n\nRoot cause: Seed script assumed employees table deprecated but Employee\nmodel still uses it, causing empty table and all test failures.\n\nProgress: Verified database seeding works, individual tests pass.\nRemaining: Test isolation issues when running full suite.","tree":{"sha":"ce08226cf56eb7cf0b4bc1aaa3a6be2a74465d61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/ce08226cf56eb7cf0b4bc1aaa3a6be2a74465d61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/818cc371fdad97d318250da432af1edd7c856e33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/818cc371fdad97d318250da432af1edd7c856e33","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDgxOGNjMzcxZmRhZDk3ZDMxODI1MGRhNDMyYWYxZWRkN2M4NTZlMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/44e0634d229a61e0f484dfba41206b3c7255d334","sha":"44e0634d229a61e0f484dfba41206b3c7255d334","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/44e0634d229a61e0f484dfba41206b3c7255d334"}],"sha":"818cc371fdad97d318250da432af1edd7c856e33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/818cc371fdad97d318250da432af1edd7c856e33"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/44e0634d229a61e0f484dfba41206b3c7255d334/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-26T20:16:31Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-26T20:16:31Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Add frontend validation and improve E2E test infrastructure\n\nThis commit implements several critical fixes to improve E2E test pass rate\nfrom 6/29 (21%) to 10/29 (34%) - a 66% improvement.\n\nFrontend Fixes (EmployeesPage.jsx):\n1. Add missing required field validation (lines 242-257)\n   - Validate firstName, lastName required\n   - Validate email format with regex\n   - Previously only validated extended fields\n\n2. Enhance Snackbar notification visibility (lines 1072-1088)\n   - Add explicit positioning: anchorOrigin top-center\n   - Set z-index: 10000 to appear above dialogs\n   - Increase autoHideDuration from 4s to 6s\n   - Add explicit width styling for better visibility\n\n3. Fix dialog closing timing issue (lines 288-290)\n   - Add 100ms setTimeout before setDialogOpen(false)\n   - Workaround for React 18+ state batching\n   - Allows notification to render before dialog closes\n\nTest Helper Fixes (employee-helpers.ts):\n1. Fix submitEmployeeForm incorrect assumptions (lines 119-130)\n   - Add optional waitForClose parameter (default: false)\n   - Success scenarios: Pass waitForClose=true\n   - Error scenarios: Dialog stays open, don''t wait\n   - Prevents timeouts on validation/API errors\n\nTest File Updates (01-employee-crud.spec.ts):\n1. Update all 28 submitEmployeeForm() calls with correct parameter\n   - Success tests: submitEmployeeForm(true) - wait for close\n   - Validation errors: submitEmployeeForm() - stay open\n   - API errors: submitEmployeeForm() - stay open\n\nTest Results (10/29 passing, 34%):\nPASSING:\n- ✓ All validation tests (01.03-01.05, 01.07)\n- ✓ Cancel operation test (01.09)\n- ✓ All search tests (02.01, 02.03-02.05)\n- ✓ Permission test (05.02)\n\nSTILL FAILING:\n- ✗ Notification visibility (01.01, 01.06, etc)\n- ✗ Dialog closing for successful ops\n- ✗ Some validation messages (01.08 max hours)\n- ✗ Role filter timeouts (02.06-02.07)\n- ✗ Update/delete operations (03.01-04.03)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5fa5ca21ac90b1e34f2ef10414c9d08e1435ba06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/5fa5ca21ac90b1e34f2ef10414c9d08e1435ba06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/44e0634d229a61e0f484df