ttps://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/bb5245ea1c3e89f0aaa2b934b3b0e262cc152e53"}],"sha":"efd9c255f4e6f187ce6a9fa7dfd99d27e7791e55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/efd9c255f4e6f187ce6a9fa7dfd99d27e7791e55"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/bb5245ea1c3e89f0aaa2b934b3b0e262cc152e53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-26T19:24:36Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-26T19:24:36Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"swarm: Apply hive-mind coordinated fixes for E2E tests\n\nSwarm Coordination Summary:\n- Initialized hierarchical swarm with 7 specialized agents\n- Agents: analyst, form-specialist, role-fixer, menu-fixer, reviewer, tester, form-fixer\n\nFixes Applied by Swarm:\n1. Submit button selector: Changed from /save|create|submit|add employee/i to /(add|update) employee/i\n2. Role filter: Updated multi-select dropdown handling with proper MUI selectors\n3. Actions menu: Fixed Card-based button selector with MuiIconButton locator\n\nTest Results: 6/29 passing (21%) - NO IMPROVEMENT\n\nRoot Cause Analysis by Swarm:\n- Form dialogs not closing after submission (button stays visible)\n- Success/validation messages not appearing\n- Frontend form submission logic may need investigation\n- Role filter still timing out at keyboard.press(''Escape'')\n- Some tests looking for table rows instead of Card components\n\nSwarm Findings Documented in:\n- /docs/e2e-analysis-findings.md\n- /docs/reviews/SWARM_REVIEW_20251126.md\n\nNext Actions (Swarm Recommendations):\n1. Debug frontend handleFormSubmit() error handling\n2. Investigate why dialog doesn''t close after API response\n3. Add frontend validation before submission\n4. Fix remaining table-based selectors for Card layout","tree":{"sha":"9815b02