blems\n\nNext Steps:\n  - Debug form dialog selectors\n  - Fix submit button detection\n  - Investigate role filter dropdown\n  - Continue iterative E2E test debugging","tree":{"sha":"974a00b71152e1286668eed02a43154d679660ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/974a00b71152e1286668eed02a43154d679660ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/890e9a95dd3730ccebc9c254be40118589c2eb47","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/890e9a95dd3730ccebc9c254be40118589c2eb47","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDg5MGU5YTk1ZGQzNzMwY2NlYmM5YzI1NGJlNDAxMTg1ODljMmViNDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/f8b4df44cf64d6ed23ac5726da2ef77742485663","sha":"f8b4df44cf64d6ed23ac5726da2ef77742485663","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/f8b4df44cf64d6ed23ac5726da2ef77742485663"}],"sha":"890e9a95dd3730ccebc9c254be40118589c2eb47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/890e9a95dd3730ccebc9c254be40118589c2eb47"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/f8b4df44cf64d6ed23ac5726da2ef77742485663/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-26T18:53:43Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-26T18:53:43Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Resolve frontend crash from department object rendering\n\n- Fixed department field handling: API returns object with {name, ...} but frontend expected string\n- Updated EmployeesPage.jsx line 384: Extract department.name for unique filter list\n- Updated EmployeesPage.jsx line 590: Display department.name instead of object\n- Updated filterUtils.js line 91: Handle department object in filter comparison\n- Fixed incorrect Divider import: Moved from @mui/icons-material to @mui/material\n- Updated E2E test helper: Changed waitForTableLoad() to wait for MuiCard-root (Card layout, not table)\n\nThis fixes the ''Oops! Something went wrong'' error boundary that was preventing\nemployee cards from rendering. React was crashing when trying to render the\ndepartment object directly instead of the department name string.\n\nBackend API returns: {department: {name: ''Administration'', ...}}\nFrontend now correctly extracts: department.name\n\nTest status: 02.01 Should display all employees - PASSING ✅","tree":{"sha":"18fb0c98bcb729e3e9025558035215f01ae257ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/18fb0c98bcb729e3e9025558035215f01ae257ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/f8b4df44cf64d6ed23ac5726da2ef77742485663","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/f8b4df44cf64d6ed23ac5726da2ef77742485663","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKGY4YjRkZjQ0Y2Y2NGQ2ZWQyM2FjNTcyNmRhMmVmNzc3NDI0ODU2NjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/069a5ac01b6a30b9a9940a14f3bdeb670f97cb1c","sha":"069a5ac01b6a30b9a9940a14f3bdeb670f97cb1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/069a5ac01b6a30b9a9940a14f3bdeb670f97cb1c"}],"sha":"f8b4df44cf64d6ed23ac5726da2ef77742485663","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/f8b4df44cf64d6ed23ac5726da2ef77742485663"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/069a5ac01b6a30b9a9940a14f3bdeb670f97cb1c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-26T18:29:17Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-26T18:29:17Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix(e2e): Fix authentication and serialization issues blocking E2E tests\n\nCRITICAL FIXES:\n1. Backend dependencies.py: Modified get_current_user() to accept JWT from cookies as fallback\n   - Added Cookie import from FastAPI\n   - Now checks Authorization header first, then falls back to access_token cookie\n   - Fixes 401 errors when frontend sends cookie-based auth\n\n2. Backend employees.py: Fixed Pydantic serialization error\n   - Changed response_model from ''dict'' to ''List[EmployeeResponse]''\n   - Removed total/skip/limit wrapper (breaking change - returns array directly)\n   - Fixes 500 Internal Server Error: Unable to serialize User ORM objects\n\n3. Frontend EmployeesPage.jsx: Updated to handle new API response format\n   - API now returns array directly instead of {employees: [...]}\n   - Added array check for safety\n\nIMPACT:\n- Employees API now works with cookie-based authentication\n- GET /api/employees returns 200 with proper JSON serialization\n- Frontend can now load and display employee list\n- E2E tests can proceed past authentication and data loading\n\nTesting: Verified with curl that API returns 8 employees correctly","tree":{"sha":"722a935a910390444a004aba96982b3ab6020f14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/722a935a910390444a004aba96982b3ab6020f14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/069a5ac01b6a30b9a9940a14f3bdeb670f97cb1c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/069a5ac01b6a30b9a9940a14f3bdeb670f97cb1c","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDA2OWE1YWMwMWI2YTMwYjlhOTk0MGExNGYzYmRlYjY3MGY5N2NiMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTu