ement and audit trails\n  * Extended fields (qualifications, availability, hourly rate)\n  * Error handling and rate limiting documentation\n\n- DEVELOPER_GUIDE.md: Complete development setup guide\n  * Project structure and environment setup\n  * Database migration procedures\n  * Code style guide (KISS, DRY, single responsibility)\n  * RBAC implementation patterns\n  * Performance best practices (N+1 query prevention)\n  * Security checklist\n  * Adding new endpoints guide\n\n- USER_GUIDE.md: End-user documentation\n  * User roles and permission matrix\n  * Employee management workflows\n  * Password management procedures\n  * Extended employee fields usage\n  * Search, filtering, and pagination\n  * Audit trail viewing\n  * Troubleshooting guide\n\n- MIGRATION_GUIDE.md: Database and deployment procedures\n  * Alembic migration workflows\n  * Backup and rollback procedures\n  * Migration testing checklist\n  * Production deployment steps\n  * Zero-downtime migration strategies\n  * Troubleshooting guide\n\n- README.md: Updated with Weeks 1-4 features\n  * Comprehensive feature list\n  * API endpoint reference\n  * Enhanced security documentation\n  * Week-by-week implementation summary\n  * Documentation links\n\nAll documentation reflects Weeks 1-4 implementations including:\n- Complete employee CRUD with RBAC\n- Extended fields (qualifications, availability, rates)\n- Password and account status management\n- Comprehensive audit trails\n- Advanced search and filtering\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"89b4475b9721976632cf7bd1fbbbb3134e10f4a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/89b4475b9721976632cf7bd1fbbbb3134e10f4a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/4a9ae6420dfbc3b7fbf1188884d14e43aa6f80d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/4a9ae6420dfbc3b7fbf1188884d14e43aa6f80d7","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDRhOWFlNjQyMGRmYmMzYjdmYmYxMTg4ODg0ZDE0ZTQzYWE2ZjgwZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/c6c3b8f7a9fc006cbbbee59e642cdb1a24bdd7b7","sha":"c6c3b8f7a9fc006cbbbee59e642cdb1a24bdd7b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/c6c3b8f7a9fc006cbbbee59e642cdb1a24bdd7b7"}],"sha":"4a9ae6420dfbc3b7fbf1188884d14e43aa6f80d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/4a9ae6420dfbc3b7fbf1188884d14e43aa6f80d7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/c6c3b8f7a9fc006cbbbee59e642cdb1a24bdd7b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-25T05:40:37Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-25T05:40:37Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"style: Remove debug statements and improve error logging in employees.py\n\n**Code Cleanup (Priority 6)**:\n- Removed all debug print statements ([DEBUG], [ERROR])\n- Replaced print() with proper logging.error() calls\n- Added exc_info=True for comprehensive error context\n- Removed traceback.print_exc() in favor of structured logging\n- Applied Black formatter for consistent code style\n- Applied isort for organized imports\n\n**Improved Error Handling (Priority 7)**:\n- All exception handlers now use Python logging module\n- Consistent error logging pattern across all endpoints\n- Full exception context captured with exc_info=True\n- Better error visibility for debugging and monitoring\n\n**Changes**:\n- /backend/src/api/employees.py:\n  - Removed: print(f\"[DEBUG] Executing employees query...\")\n  - Removed: print(f\"[DEBUG] Found {len(users)} users...\")\n  - Removed: print(f\"[ERROR] Error fetching employees...\")\n  - Removed: traceback.print_exc()\n  - Added: logger.error(..., exc_info=True) in all exception handlers\n\n**Benefits**:\n- Cleaner, more professional codebase\n- Consistent logging approach\n- Better error tracking in production\n- Following Python best practices\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"669896f4466da10b1f4fdd177dd4d76aa723f879","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/669896f4466da10b1f4fdd177dd4d76aa723f879"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/c6c3b8f7a9fc006cbbbee59e642cdb1a24bdd7b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/c6c3b8f7a9fc006cbbbee59e642cdb1a24bdd7b7","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKGM2YzNiOGY3YTlmYzAwNmNiYmJlZTU5ZTY0MmNkYjFhMjRiZGQ3Yjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/e919daffd5a6b56d23a2afff29fd608fc1e6697c","sha":"e919daffd5a6b56d23a2afff29fd608fc1e6697c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/e919daffd5a6b56d23a2afff29fd608fc1e6697c"}],"sha":"c6c3b8f7a9fc006cbbbee59e642cdb1a24bdd7b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/c6c3b8f7a9fc006cbbbee59e642cdb1a24bdd7b7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/e919daffd5a6b56d23a2afff29fd608fc1e6697c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-25T05:39:51Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-25T05:39:51Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"refactor: Extract employee service layer and add PropTypes\n\n**Service Layer Extraction (Priority 1)**:\n- Created /backend/src/services/employee_service.py\n- Extracted business logic from API routes for separation of concerns\n- EmployeeService class with methods:\n  - create_employee(data, db, current_user_id)\n  - update_employee(employee_id, data, db, current_user_id, is_admin)\n  - delete_employee(employee_id, db, current_user_id)\n  - get_employee(employee_id, db)\n  - search_employees(db, filters, pagination)\n  - validate_extended_fields(data)\n  - log_department_change(db, employee_id, from_dept, to_dept, changed_by)\n  - update_user_role(db, user_id, new_role, changed_by_id)\n  - check_password_history(db, user_id, new_password)\n  - save_password_to_history(db, user_id, password_hash)\n- Improved error handling with specific HTTPExceptions\n- Added comprehensive logging throughout\n- Sanitized all text inputs to prevent XSS\n- Formatted with Black and isort\n\n**Frontend PropTypes (Priority 2)**:\n- Added PropTypes to AccountStatusDialog.jsx\n- Added PropTypes to PasswordResetDialog.jsx\n- Added PropTypes to ChangePasswordDialog.jsx\n- Ensures type safety and better developer experience\n\n**Benefits**:\n- Separation of concerns (API routes vs business logic)\n- Easier testing (can mock service layer)\n- Reusable business logic\n- Cleaner API routes\n- Better code organization following KISS and DRY principles\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"49c12112d16dbe72fda45a27d39319c2033ae0c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/49c12112d16dbe72fda45a27d39319c2033ae0c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/e919daffd5a6b56d23a2afff29fd608fc1e6697c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/e919daffd5a6b56d23a2afff29fd608fc1e6697c","node_id":"C_