59b063c6a3b154cd7e5f0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/eac2d98c33a44d3cd8686bd028906d9145aeb6d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-25T04:46:36Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-25T04:46:36Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"perf: Fix N+1 queries with eager loading and indexes\n\n- Add eager loading for roles in employee list endpoint\n- Implement bulk department loading to prevent N+1 queries\n- Add eager loading to single employee endpoint\n- Create database indexes for performance:\n  * department_id for JOIN operations\n  * first_name, last_name for search queries\n  * Composite index on (last_name, first_name) for sorting\n  * is_active for filtering\n  * Composite index on (is_active, department_id)\n- Add performance test suite\n- Document performance improvements\n\nQuery reduction:\n- List endpoint: 1+N queries → 3 queries (97% reduction for 100 employees)\n- Single endpoint: 2 queries with optimized eager loading\n\nExpected performance gains:\n- Search queries: 10-100x faster\n- Sorted results: 2-5x faster\n- Department filtering: 5-20x faster","tree":{"sha":"f97e5a5158ca9ca378a73a8c2ac19e6875ffde22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/f97e5a5158ca9ca378a73a8c2ac19e6875ffde22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/eac2d98c33a44d3cd8686bd028906d9145aeb6d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/eac2d98c33a44d3cd8686bd028906d9145aeb6d2","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKGVhYzJkOThjMzNhNDRkM2NkODY4NmJkMDI4OTA2ZDkxNDVhZWI2ZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/090b22c264