REORGANIZATION:\nArchived:\n  - PROGRESS_REPORT.md → docs/archive/progress-reports/\n  - FEATURE_FIX_REPORT.md → docs/archive/feature-reports/\n  - SECURITY_FIXES_SUMMARY.md → docs/archive/security/\n\nTechnical Debt:\n  - CRITICAL_FIXES_ROADMAP.md → docs/technical-debt/\n  - SCHEDULE_MODEL_ISSUES.md → docs/technical-debt/\n  - P2_DATABASE_OPTIMIZATION_FILES.txt → docs/technical-debt/\n\nTesting:\n  - E2E_TEST_REPORT.md → docs/testing/\n  - TEST_COVERAGE_EVALUATION.md → docs/testing/\n  - TEST_EXECUTION_REPORT.md → docs/testing/\n\nDeployment:\n  - README-DEPLOYMENT.md → docs/deployment/DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md\n  - README-DOCKER-DEPLOYMENT.md → docs/deployment/DOCKER_DEPLOYMENT.md\n\nNEW DOCUMENTATION:\n- docs/DOCUMENTATION_CLEANUP_REPORT.md - Comprehensive analysis and recommendations\n\nBENEFITS:\n- Documentation now accurately reflects codebase\n- Improved developer onboarding experience\n- Clear separation of current vs planned features\n- Better organization for historical reports\n- Reduced confusion about project capabilities\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code","tree":{"sha":"4ea957afd5298f3888a9f763abd65b232fb464fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/4ea957afd5298f3888a9f763abd65b232fb464fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/2b92d887fdb435450a84823ea80e21a6c0312db4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/2b92d887fdb435450a84823ea80e21a6c0312db4","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDJiOTJkODg3ZmRiNDM1NDUwYTg0ODIzZWE4MGUyMWE2YzAzMTJkYjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/14524b12c36883a787c806e95db938fd7af525a2","sha":"14524b12c36883a787c806e95db938fd7af525a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/14524b12c36883a787c806e95db938fd7af525a2"}],"sha":"2b92d887fdb435450a84823ea80e21a6c0312db4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/2b92d887fdb435450a84823ea80e21a6c0312db4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/14524b12c36883a787c806e95db938fd7af525a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-22T07:50:06Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-22T07:50:06Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Implement instant redirect on invalid authentication\n\n- Add parseJwt and isTokenExpired utilities to AuthContext and API service\n- Validate token expiry BEFORE restoring session from localStorage\n- Clear expired tokens immediately without attempting refresh\n- Add token validation in API request interceptor\n- Prevent unnecessary 401 errors and delayed redirects\n- Set proper loading states on login/register pages\n\nFixes issue where page refresh with expired token caused prolonged\nloading and delayed redirect to login. Now instantly detects expired\ntokens and redirects immediately.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c37ea580c28cb3c46e04756498838fb2f0bae295","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/c37ea580c28cb3c46e04756498838fb2f0bae295"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/14524b12c36883a787c806e95db938fd7af525a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/14524b12c36883a787c806e95db938fd7af525a2","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDE0NTI0YjEyYzM2ODgzYTc4N2M4MDZlOTVkYjkzOGZkN2FmNTI1YTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/3c6fa28968a36c86b6bc0cca85947883ed83884c","sha":"3c6fa28968a36c86b6bc0cca85947883ed83884c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/3c6fa28968a36c86b6bc0cca85947883ed83884c"}],"sha":"14524b12c36883a787c806e95db938fd7af525a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/14524b12c36883a787c806e95db938fd7af525a2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/3c6fa28968a36c86b6bc0cca85947883ed83884c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-22T06:26:45Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-22T06:26:45Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"test: Add comprehensive E2E tests for department management features\n\n- Complete workflow tests for department schedule management\n- Conflict detection and resolution testing\n- Interactive calendar functionality tests\n- Accessibility and mobile testing coverage\n- Comprehensive test fixtures and setup utilities\n- Support for multiple browsers and viewports","tree":{"sha":"2ddd4a45a86612584ab6e8800edf96031747fa5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/2ddd4a45a86612584ab6e8800edf96031747fa5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/3c6fa28968a36c86b6bc0cca85947883ed83884c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/3c6fa28968a36c86b6bc0cca85947883ed83884c","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDNjNmZhMjg5NjhhMzZjODZiNmJjMGNjYTg1OTQ3ODgzZWQ4Mzg4NGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/b08b93ba3010b1fcd0814d63f64be8ea91b9a7d4","sha":"b08b93ba3010b1fcd0814d63f64be8ea91b9a7d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/b08b93ba3010b1fcd0814d63f64be8ea91b9a7d4"}],"sha":"3c6fa28968a36c86b6bc0cca85947883ed83884c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/3c6fa28968a36c86b6bc0cca85947883ed83884c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/b08b93ba3010b1fcd0814d63f64be8ea91b9a7d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-22T06:25:24Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-22T06:25:24Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"feat: Add schedule conflict detection service\n\n- Implement comprehensive conflict detection logic in conflict_detection.py\n  - Detect overlapping shifts for same employee\n  - Check double-booking conflicts\n  - Validate shift duration limits (max hours per day/week)\n  - Check minimum rest period between shifts (8 hours default)\n  - Verify department coverage requirements (understaffed/overstaffed)\n  - Return detailed conflict reports with severity levels\n\n- Add Pydantic schemas for conflict responses in schemas.py\n  - ConflictDetail: Individual conflict with severity and resolution\n  - ConflictReport: Comprehensive department schedule analysis\n  - ValidateAssignmentRequest/Response: Assignment validation\n  - CheckCoverageRequest/Response: Coverage adequacy check\n  - ConflictDetectionSettings: Configurable validation rules\n\n- Integrate conflict detection into department API endpoints\n  - POST /api/departments/{id}/validate-assignment: Validate employee assignment\n  - POST /api/departments/{id}/check-coverage: Check staffing coverage\n  - GET /api/departments/{id}/conflict-report: Generate comprehensive conflict report\n\nFeatures:\n- Multiple conflict types: overlapping, double-booking, excessive hours, insufficient rest, coverage issues\n- Severity levels: critical, high, medium, low, info\n- Actionable resolution suggestions for each conflict\n- Configurable limits for hours and rest periods\n- Department-level coverage analysis\n\nTechnical:\n- Async SQLAlchemy queries with proper relationship loading\n- Time overlap detection handling midnight-crossing shifts\n- Daily and weekly hour tracking\n- Rest period validation between consecutive shifts\n- Qualification and availability enforcement","tree":{"sha":"b590416358c83d280c942b2bdc5579c62b193d2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/b590416358c83d280c942b2bdc5579c62b193d2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/b08b93ba3010b1fcd0814d63f64be8ea91b9a7d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/b08b93ba3010b1fcd0814d63f64be8ea91b9a7d4","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKGIwOGI5M2JhMzAxMGIxZmNkMDgxNGQ2M2Y2NGJlOGVhOTFiOWE3ZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/235723d22cbd225d52d4df0800465fbc1c33a0a7","sha":"235723d22cbd225d52d4df0800465fbc1c33a0a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/235723d22cbd225d52d4df0800465fbc1c33a0a7"}],"sha":"b08b93ba3010b1fcd0814d63f64be8ea91b9a7d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/b08b93ba3010b1fcd0814d63f64be8ea91b9a7d4"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=36f8868e1ae2d3b94b0341a0f7a478b61eaf8d17&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A16%3A48.190Z"}');
