ev"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T20:06:55.177Z","repositoryId":1040276198,"sha":"6cf933d5db5502c743ce53344338f5a75e1c3f98"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T20:06:55.177Z","raw":[{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/235723d22cbd225d52d4df0800465fbc1c33a0a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-22T06:23:12Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-22T06:23:12Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"feat: Add comprehensive department schedule analytics dashboard\n\n- Created DepartmentScheduleAnalytics.jsx component with Chart.js visualizations\n- Coverage percentage trends with area chart and target line\n- Overtime hours by employee with bar chart\n- Labor cost breakdown by shift type with pie chart\n- Staffing gaps table with severity indicators and recommendations\n- Week-over-week and month-over-month trend analysis\n- Auto-refresh capability with configurable intervals\n- Date range picker for custom analysis periods\n- Export functionality for PDF, Excel, and CSV formats\n\nBackend Implementation:\n- Added /api/departments/{id}/schedule-analytics endpoint\n- Comprehensive metrics calculation including coverage, overtime, costs\n- Staffing gap detection with severity levels and recommendations\n- Trend analysis with week-over-week and month-over-month comparisons\n- Added /api/departments/{id}/analytics/export endpoint for report generation\n- Support for CSV export with full metrics breakdown\n\nService Layer:\n- Enhanced getDepartmentAnalytics() to support date ranges\n- Added exportAnalyticsReport() for file downloads\n- Automatic file download handling via blob responses\n\nFeatures:\n- Real-time data refresh\n- Interactive charts with tooltips\n- Responsive grid layout\n- Key metrics summary cards\n- Detailed overtime and staffing tables\n- Filter by employee, shift type, or metric type\n- Professional UI with Tailwind CSS\n\nAnalytics Metrics:\n- Average coverage percentage\n- Total overtime hours and costs\n- Labor cost breakdown by shift type\n- Cost per hour analysis\n- Staffing gap identification\n- Trend analysis (WoW, MoM)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cdfe00bf276d2bfca25de9b84db015e946b5cfd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/cdfe00bf276d2bfca25de9b84db015e946b5cfd0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/235723d22cbd225d52d4df0800465fbc1c33a0a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/235723d22cbd225d52d4df0800465fbc1c33a0a7","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDIzNTcyM2QyMmNiZDIyNWQ1MmQ0ZGYwODAwNDY1ZmJjMWMzM2EwYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/e4cdb31a7f483e2ea5c4faae40ce0242ff0abf35","sha":"e4cdb31a7f483e2ea5c4faae40ce0242ff0abf35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/e4cdb31a7f483e2ea5c4faae40ce0242ff0abf35"}],"sha":"235723d22cbd225d52d4df0800465fbc1c33a0a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/235723d22cbd225d52d4df0800465fbc1c33a0a7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/e4cdb31a7f483e2ea5c4faae40ce0242ff0abf35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-22T06:22:24Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-22T06:22:24Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"feat: Add DepartmentScheduleCalendar component with multi-view support\n\n- Implemented comprehensive calendar with month/week/day views\n- Added color-coding by shift type (morning/afternoon/night/custom)\n- Implemented conflict detection and coverage gap highlighting\n- Added quick shift editing capabilities with dialog\n- Implemented coverage indicators (understaffed/optimal/overstaffed)\n- Added export functionality (PDF/print)\n- Integrated auto-refresh every 60 seconds\n- Added responsive design for mobile devices\n- Implemented filtering by employee, shift type\n- Added route /departments/:id/calendar with role protection\n- Used Material-UI components and date-fns for date handling\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c97b90b26db68b8ff62a8325848a0f124f08f65f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/c97b90b26db68b8ff62a8325848a0f124f08f65f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/e4cdb31a7f483e2ea5c4faae40ce0242ff0abf35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/e4cdb31a7f483e2ea5c4faae40ce0242ff0abf35","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKGU0Y2RiMzFhN2Y0ODNlMmVhNWM0ZmFhZTQwY2UwMjQyZmYwYWJmMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/b290a8a767f82f07b83752a80024051a0352b626","sha":"b290a8a767f82f07b83752a80024051a0352b626","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/b290a8a767f82f07b83752a80024051a0352b626"}],"sha":"e4cdb31a7f483e2ea5c4faae40ce0242ff0abf35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/e4cdb31a7f483e2ea5c4faae40ce0242ff0abf35"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/b290a8a767f82f07b83752a80024051a0352b626/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-22T06:14:18Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-22T06:14:18Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"test: Add comprehensive frontend tests for department components\n\nAdded three comprehensive test suites totaling ~1500 LOC with 90+ test cases:\n\n1. **departmentService.enhanced.test.js** (380 LOC)\n   - CRUD operations (getDepartments, createDepartment, updateDepartment, deleteDepartment)\n   - Bulk assignment operations (bulkAssignDepartment, transferDepartment)\n   - Analytics operations (getDepartmentAnalyticsOverview, getDepartmentDistribution)\n   - History tracking (getEmployeeDepartmentHistory)\n   - Comprehensive error handling\n   - Edge case coverage\n   - Uses axios-mock-adapter for API mocking\n\n2. **DepartmentScheduleManager.test.jsx** (582 LOC)\n   - Schedule list rendering and display\n   - Create schedule flow with validation\n   - Template selection and application\n   - Pagination controls and navigation\n   - Filtering by status, date range\n   - Search functionality\n   - Error handling and retry logic\n   - Schedule actions (delete, duplicate, navigate)\n   - Uses MockAdapter for API testing\n\n3. **DepartmentEmployeeAssignment.test.jsx** (556 LOC)\n   - Component rendering (departments, unassigned employees)\n   - Native HTML5 drag-and-drop functionality\n   - Bulk selection with checkboxes\n   - Bulk assignment operations\n   - Transfer dialog workflow\n   - Search and filter capabilities\n   - Comprehensive error handling\n   - Uses MockAdapter for API mocking\n\n**Testing Stack:**\n- Jest with React Testing Library\n- axios-mock-adapter for API mocking\n- @testing-library/jest-dom for assertions\n- Native HTML5 drag-drop (no react-dnd dependency)\n\n**Coverage:**\n- User interactions (clicks, form inputs, drag-drop)\n- API integration and error states\n- Loading states and async operations\n- Edge cases (empty data, validation errors)\n- Success/failure scenarios\n- Component state management\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d05b176f9ddae331daadf95fdfc8c17ffa3ac0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/4d05b176f9ddae331daadf95fdfc8c17ffa3ac0b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/b290a8a767f82f07b83752a80024051a0352b626","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/b290a8a767f82f07b83752a80024051a0352b626","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKGIyOTBhOGE3NjdmODJmMDdiODM3NTJhODAwMjQwNTFhMDM1MmI2MjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/be961043769a22dee3064540eb3e1475bfcc934b","sha":"be961043769a22dee3064540eb3e1475bfcc934b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/be961043769a22dee3064540eb3e1475bfcc934b"}],"sha":"b290a8a767f82f07b83752a80024051a0352b626","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/b290a8a767f82f07b83752a80024051a0352b626"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/be961043769a22dee3064540eb3e1475bfcc934b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-22T06:13:23Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-22T06:13:23Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"docs: Add comprehensive department assignment API documentation\n\n- Complete endpoint reference for bulk assign and transfer\n- Request/response schemas with examples\n- Implementation details and database schema\n- Security, performance, and caching documentation\n- Usage examples for common scenarios\n- Error handling guidance\n- Testin