ors\n  * Edge cases and error handling\n\n- backend/tests/test_department_schedules.py (24 tests, 914 lines)\n  * Schedule retrieval with pagination and filtering\n  * Schedule creation and validation\n  * Schedule overview with metrics\n  * Template creation and application\n  * Permission checks for manager/admin roles\n\nTest Coverage:\n- Bulk assignment operations (valid/invalid/mixed IDs)\n- Employee transfers with audit trails\n- Transaction integrity and rollback\n- Schedule CRUD operations\n- Template management\n- Date range filtering and validation\n- Department capacity limits\n- Permission-based access control\n- Edge cases (invalid IDs, date ranges, pagination)\n\nAll tests use async fixtures, proper error handling, and database verification.\nTests compile successfully and are ready for execution once API endpoints are implemented.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b4c539035fec7a696cbd5f8ad9314c3102762ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/9b4c539035fec7a696cbd5f8ad9314c3102762ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/cf3d6f40c2bc94dff24d1fd8642cf60f07b84d1c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/cf3d6f40c2bc94dff24d1fd8642cf60f07b84d1c","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKGNmM2Q2ZjQwYzJiYzk0ZGZmMjRkMWZkODY0MmNmNjBmMDdiODRkMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/3dfcfb9b3d066357d5e4ef7c9011b7e6f2f30048","sha":"3dfcfb9b3d066357d5e4ef7c9011b7e6f2f30048","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/3dfcfb9b3d066357d5e4ef7c9011b7e6f2f30048"}],"sha":"cf3d6f40c2bc94dff24d1fd8642cf60f07b84d1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/cf3d6f40c2bc94dff24d1fd8642cf60f07b84d1c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/3dfcfb9b3d066357d5e4ef7c9011b7e6f2f30048/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-22T06:12:00Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-22T06:12:00Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"feat: Add department assignment API endpoints with bulk assign and transfer\n\nImplementation Details:\n- POST /api/departments/{id}/employees/bulk-assign endpoint\n- POST /api/departments/{id}/employees/{employee_id}/transfer endpoint\n- Pydantic schemas in schemas_department_assignment.py:\n  * BulkAssignRequest (employee_ids, reason, effective_date)\n  * TransferRequest (to_department_id, reason, requires_approval)\n  * AssignmentResponse with assignment details\n  * TransferResponse with transfer details\n- CRUD operations in crud_department_assignment.py:\n  * bulk_assign_employees function with transaction support\n  * transfer_employee function with transaction support\n  * Both create DepartmentAssignmentHistory records\n  * Automatic rollback on errors\n- API endpoints in departments_assignment.py:\n  * Manager/admin permission required\n  * Comprehensive error handling and validation\n  * Cache invalidation for affected departments and employees\n  * Detailed logging for audit trail\n\nTechnical Features:\n- Transactional integrity with SQLAlchemy\n- Proper foreign key relationships to User and Department models\n- Audit trail via DepartmentAssignmentHistory model\n- Cache invalidation after assignments\n- Support for partial success in bulk operations\n- Comprehensive error reporting\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"00799b92d1aa923c4e955b58b506ed644bc0552a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tin