e, ScheduleTemplateResponse\n  * TemplateApplyRequest\n\n- Add 5 CRUD functions in crud_department:\n  * get_department_schedules - Fetch with filtering\n  * create_department_schedule - Create with validation\n  * get_schedule_overview - Consolidated view with metrics\n  * create_template - Template creation\n  * apply_template - Template application\n\n- All endpoints include:\n  * Proper error handling and validation\n  * Pagination support where applicable\n  * Manager role authentication\n  * Comprehensive documentation\n\nReference: docs/features/department-schedule-management.md","tree":{"sha":"a6c7e2a7905212dba257b7512800ccc86844efac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/a6c7e2a7905212dba257b7512800ccc86844efac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/07c9ac30965fa20cb02c5766500da9a2dc7b2a9e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/07c9ac30965fa20cb02c5766500da9a2dc7b2a9e","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDA3YzlhYzMwOTY1ZmEyMGNiMDJjNTc2NjUwMGRhOWEyZGM3YjJhOWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/7b8cd33c752c477e7a0eb23909c1d31d15b80feb","sha":"7b8cd33c752c477e7a0eb23909c1d31d15b80feb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/7b8cd33c752c477e7a0eb23909c1d31d15b80feb"}],"sha":"07c9ac30965fa20cb02c5766500da9a2dc7b2a9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/07c9ac30965fa20cb02c5766500da9a2dc7b2a9e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/7b8cd33c752c477e7a0eb23909c1d31d15b80feb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-22T06:09:49Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-22T06:09:49