% fewer database queries\n- All success criteria met\n\nQuick Setup:\n1. alembic upgrade head\n2. Install Redis\n3. Set REDIS_ENABLED=true\n4. pip install redis hiredis locust\n\nNext Phase: P3 (2 hours for 50-100x additional gains)\n\nStatus: P2 COMPLETE ✅","tree":{"sha":"bf60c5f4ee8ed9659ad409506ae7d881535d35a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/bf60c5f4ee8ed9659ad409506ae7d881535d35a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/dc4793d976abe08b689416bea28f67e66ed89801","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/dc4793d976abe08b689416bea28f67e66ed89801","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKGRjNDc5M2Q5NzZhYmUwOGI2ODk0MTZiZWEyOGY2N2U2NmVkODk4MDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/931069411cd6b2be1a0adfae2ce653e35e443909","sha":"931069411cd6b2be1a0adfae2ce653e35e443909","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/931069411cd6b2be1a0adfae2ce653e35e443909"}],"sha":"dc4793d976abe08b689416bea28f67e66ed89801","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/dc4793d976abe08b689416bea28f67e66ed89801"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/931069411cd6b2be1a0adfae2ce653e35e443909/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-21T19:20:36Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-21T19:20:36Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"feat(ui): Add 6 department management UI components\n\nComponents added:\n- DepartmentAnalyticsChart: Real-time analytics dashboard with Chart.js\n- BulkAssignmentModal: Batch employee assignment with progress tracking\n- AssignmentHistoryTimeline: Audit trail visualization with Material-UI Timeline\n- UnassignedEmployeesList: Manage unassigned employees with quick assign\n- DepartmentTransferDialog: Department transfer workflow wizard\n- DepartmentSelector: Reusable hierarchical department picker\n\nFeatures:\n- Material-UI design system throughout\n- Comprehensive error handling and loading states\n- Real-time auto-refresh (30s for analytics)\n- Export to CSV functionality\n- Responsive and accessible (WCAG 2.1 AA)\n- Full test coverage with React Testing Library\n- Search, filter, and pagination support\n- Optimistic UI updates\n- Keyboard navigation\n\nTechnical Details:\n- Chart.js integration for data visualization\n- Material-UI components (Dialog, Stepper, Timeline, DataGrid)\n- API integration via centralized api.js service\n- snake_case to camelCase transformation\n- localStorage for recent selections\n- React hooks for state management\n\nDocumentation:\n- Comprehensive README with usage examples\n- JSDoc comments on all components\n- Test suites for all components\n- Integration guide for existing app\n\nCompletes frontend integration (68% → 100%)\nResolves P1 UI component gap from integration assessment\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"890d90ae54bae2b01496a9dfafd2ca4a32af17f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/890d90ae54bae2b01496a9dfafd2ca4a32af17f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/931069411cd6b2be1a0adfae2ce653e35e443909","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/931069411cd6b2be1a0adfae2ce653e35e443909","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDkzMTA2OTQxMWNkNmIyYmUxYTBhZGZhZTJjZTY1M2UzNWU0NDM5MDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/