age below 80% target (MEDIUM - 10 days)\n\nWhat''s Working:\n- Security configuration complete (SECRET_KEY, bcrypt, JWT)\n- Local/LAN deployment model documented\n- Comprehensive documentation created\n- Solid architecture (FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL)\n- Core features functional (employees, departments, schedules)\n\nNew Documentation Delivered:\n- PRODUCTION-DEPLOYMENT-GUIDE.md (complete installation guide)\n- PRODUCTION-READINESS-CHECKLIST.md (detailed validation)\n- validate-deployment.sh (automated validation script)\n- DEPLOYMENT-READINESS-SUMMARY.md (executive overview)\n\nTimeline Estimates:\n- Minimum (P0 only): 2-3 weeks\n- Recommended (P0 + P1): 6-8 weeks\n- Total effort: ~40 person-days\n\nDeployment Model:\n- Type: Local Host / Intranet LAN Only\n- Network: Private (192.168.x.x, 10.x.x.x)\n- No public internet exposure\n- Rate limiting disabled (appropriate for LAN)\n\nValidation:\n- Automated script: ./scripts/validate-deployment.sh\n- Manual verification steps documented\n- Health checks defined\n- Success criteria established\n\nNext Steps:\n1. Review deployment readiness summary\n2. Assign owners to P0 blockers\n3. Create GitHub issues for tracking\n4. Execute Phase 1 critical fixes (2-3 weeks)\n5. Re-validate with validation script\n6. Proceed to Phase 2 quality improvements\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5ed4218a204471a07203dc979655fcce8d2240dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/5ed4218a204471a07203dc979655fcce8d2240dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/099180c2f728697ce1a14a9d53c1d1c8ac36fba1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/099180c2f728697ce1a14a9d53c1d1c8ac36fba1","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDA5OTE4MGMyZ