entials)\n  * Test coverage targets (≥80% backend, ≥75% frontend)\n  * Database optimization (indexes, migrations)\n  * Performance benchmarks (<200ms API responses)\n  * Infrastructure requirements (systemd, nginx, monitoring)\n  * Documentation completeness\n  * UAT and training requirements\n  * Sign-off tracking\n\n- Add scripts/validate-deployment.sh automated validation\n  * System prerequisites check (Python 3.9+, Node 16+, PostgreSQL)\n  * Directory structure validation\n  * Environment configuration verification\n  * SECRET_KEY security validation\n  * Database connectivity check\n  * Service health checks\n  * Security configuration audit\n  * Documentation completeness check\n  * Network configuration validation\n  * Comprehensive summary report\n\nBased on:\n- Technical debt analysis (docs/technical-debt/ANALYSIS.md)\n- Local/LAN security model (docs/deployment/LOCAL-LAN-SECURITY.md)\n- Integration guide review\n- 14 commits ahead status on fix/api-routing-and-response-handling\n\nCurrent status: NOT PRODUCTION READY (6 critical P0 blockers)\nEstimated time to production: 2-3 weeks (P0 only) or 6-8 weeks (recommended)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d7f7b4076dd70fdb401f2fbb5a4379648a67c797","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/d7f7b4076dd70fdb401f2fbb5a4379648a67c797"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/461cefc485ebaeb72355c5fde29a9c7fbdfe277f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/461cefc485ebaeb72355c5fde29a9c7fbdfe277f","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDQ2MWNlZmM0ODVlYmFlYjcyMzU1YzVmZGUyOWE5YzdmYmRmZTI3N2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/51b2926a2d47c2a2a8874f4d945b3f4e3275ef5e","sha":"51b2926a2d47c2a2a8874f4d945b3f4e3275ef5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/51b2926a2d47c2a2a8874f4d945b3f4e3275ef5e"}],"sha":"461cefc485ebaeb72355c5fde29a9c7fbdfe277f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/461cefc485ebaeb72355c5fde29a9c7fbdfe277f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/51b2926a2d47c2a2a8874f4d945b3f4e3275ef5e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-21T18:59:07Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-21T18:59:07Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"feat: Implement password reset email and notification service integration\n\nThis commit implements critical P0 and P1 TODOs from the technical debt analysis:\n\n## Password Reset Email (P0) ✅\n- Created comprehensive email templates with HTML and plain text versions\n- Integrated email service with auth routes for password reset flow\n- Added graceful error handling to prevent blocking on email failures\n- Configured base URL from settings for production flexibility\n\n## Notification Service Integration (P1) ✅\n- Created unified NotificationService for email and in-app notifications\n- Implemented schedule published notifications with email delivery\n- Added email templates for schedule published, changed, and shift reminders\n- Integrated notification service with schedule publishing endpoint\n- Batch notification support for multiple employees\n\n## Key Features\n- Professional, responsive email templates\n- Dual notifications (email + in-app)\n- Queue-based email processing (Celery/Redis)\n- Comprehensive error handling and logging\n- Configurable email providers (SendGrid/AWS SES/SMTP)\n- Security-focused implementation (token expiry, one-time use)\n\n## Files Added\n- backend/src/services/notification_service.py 