ckend/tests/test_serializers.py)\n   - 40+ test cases covering all conversion scenarios\n   - Edge case handling (empty, None, unicode, nested structures)\n   - Round-trip conversion verification\n   - Complex API response structure tests\n\n✅ Complete documentation (/docs/API_STANDARDIZATION.md)\n   - Implementation guide with examples\n   - Integration instructions for main.py\n   - Frontend migration guide\n   - API response examples (before/after)\n   - Component update checklist\n   - Testing procedures\n   - Rollback plan\n\nAPI RESPONSE TRANSFORMATION EXAMPLES:\n\nBefore (snake_case):\n{\n  \"first_name\": \"John\",\n  \"employee_id\": 123,\n  \"is_active\": true,\n  \"created_at\": \"2025-01-01T00:00:00\"\n}\n\nAfter (camelCase):\n{\n  \"firstName\": \"John\",\n  \"employeeId\": 123,\n  \"isActive\": true,\n  \"createdAt\": \"2025-01-01T00:00:00\"\n}\n\nBENEFITS:\n- Consistent JavaScript naming conventions across frontend/backend\n- Eliminates manual case transformation in frontend code\n- Type-safe with automatic conversion\n- Centralized, maintainable serialization logic\n- Comprehensive test coverage ensures reliability\n\nINTEGRATION REQUIRED:\n1. Add middleware to main.py\n2. Update API endpoints to use response helpers\n3. Update frontend TypeScript interfaces\n4. Remove manual case transformations from frontend\n5. Test all endpoints and components\n\nCOORDINATION:\n- Pre-task hook executed\n- Memory stored: swarm/api/serializers-created\n- Memory stored: swarm/api/models-serialization\n- Memory stored: swarm/api/middleware-created\n- Memory stored: swarm/api/tests-created\n- Memory stored: swarm/api/documentation-complete\n- Post-task hook completed\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: Add API standardization completion summary\n\n* feat: Replace mock schedule generation with real constraint solver\n\nIntegrated Google OR-Tools constraint-based optimization to r