mn to users table with foreign key\n- Added index on department_id for query performance\n- Properly configured ON DELETE SET NULL behavior\n\nAll tests passing, containers healthy, department assignment fully functional.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f7d32f500f18aa89ab8afb81637a8673c055e42d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/f7d32f500f18aa89ab8afb81637a8673c055e42d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/cffdb21b1b9ccbb787770eee224b646459f970c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/cffdb21b1b9ccbb787770eee224b646459f970c9","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKGNmZmRiMjFiMWI5Y2NiYjc4Nzc3MGVlZTIyNGI2NDY0NTlmOTcwYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/ec0916958633a2df4dd0f03b900b28a23f8a7c2a","sha":"ec0916958633a2df4dd0f03b900b28a23f8a7c2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/ec0916958633a2df4dd0f03b900b28a23f8a7c2a"}],"sha":"cffdb21b1b9ccbb787770eee224b646459f970c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/cffdb21b1b9ccbb787770eee224b646459f970c9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/ec0916958633a2df4dd0f03b900b28a23f8a7c2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-20T17:23:57Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-20T17:23:57Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"docs: Add comprehensive 409 error handling enhancements documentation\n\nComplete documentation of multi-layered approach to handling duplicate email\nconflicts in employee management system.\n\nEnhancements documented:\n- Proactive form guidance with helper text and placeholders\n- Client-side email uniqueness validation before API calls\n- Enhanced error message extraction with email pattern matching\n- Improved backend error responses with actionable suggestions\n- Professional exception logging with full stack traces\n\nTesting guidance and verification results included.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"847e8d2840cd82b22c52611cd8e48a4217e83958","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/847e8d2840cd82b22c52611cd8e48a4217e83958"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/ec0916958633a2df4dd0f03b900b28a23f8a7c2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/ec0916958633a2df4dd0f03b900b28a23f8a7c2a","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKGVjMDkxNjk1ODYzM2EyZGY0ZGQwZjAzYjkwMGIyOGEyM2Y4YTdjMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/a9a1bbb318873af2887a37aea6c929bed979ffdd","sha":"a9a1bbb318873af2887a37aea6c929bed979ffdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/a9a1bbb318873af2887a37aea6c929bed979ffdd"}],"sha":"ec0916958633a2df4dd0f03b900b28a23f8a7c2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/ec0916958633a2df4dd0f03b900b28a23f8a7c2a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/a9a1bbb318873af2887a37aea6c929bed979ffdd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-20T17:08:41Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-20T17:08:41Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Resolve Docker connectivity and routing issues\n\nCRITICAL FIX: Resolved frontend-backend connectivity and routing issues\nin Docker container environment.\n\nChanges:\n- Backend: Fixed health check timeout (async → sync)\n- Backend: Optimized database connection pool (50 → 20 connections)\n- Backend: Updated Dockerfile health check configuration\n- Frontend: Configured API client for Docker networking (empty REACT_APP_API_URL)\n- Docker Compose: Fixed environment variable defaults\n- Documentation: Added comprehensive fix reports and analysis\n\nResults:\n- Backend container: UNHEALTHY → HEALTHY ✅\n- Health check response: 10s+ timeout → <500ms ✅\n- DB pool utilization: 100% exhausted → 0% idle ✅\n- API routing: Working through nginx reverse proxy ✅\n- Frontend-backend connectivity: Fully operational ✅\n\nPerformance: 20x faster health checks, 60% fewer connections, 100% operational\n\nDocumentation:\n- backend/docs/BACKEND_CONNECTIVITY_FIX_REPORT.md\n- docs/docker-network-analysis-report.md\n- docs/DOCKER_CONNECTIVITY_FIX_SUMMARY.md\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code (https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d84aad62d1c631d8fff5d51e939ca8271c509179","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/d84aad62d1c631d8fff5d51e939ca8271c509179"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/a9a1bbb318873af2887a37aea6c929bed979ffdd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/a9a1bbb318873af2887a37aea6c929bed979ffdd","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKGE5YTFiYmIzMTg4NzNhZjI4ODdhMzdhZWE2YzkyOWJlZDk3OWZmZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/f68c7a29c422b892113dcc0e0835b7be95915cde","sha":"f68c7a29c422b892113dcc0e0835b7be95915cde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/f68c7a29c422b892113dcc0e0835b7be95915cde"}],"sha":"a9a1bbb318873af2887a37aea6c929bed979ffdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/a9a1bbb318873af2887a37aea6c929bed979ffdd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/f68c7a29c422b892113dcc0e0835b7be95915cde/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-20T17:00:43Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-20T17:00:43Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Resolve backend health check timeouts and connection pool issues\n\nCritical fixes for Docker health check failures:\n\n1. Health Endpoint Optimization\n   - Changed /health endpoint from async to sync function\n   - Removed any potential DB query blocking\n   - Now returns immediately without event loop delays\n\n2. Database Connection Pool Optimization\n   - Reduced pool_size from 30 to 10 connections\n   - Reduced max_overflow from 20 to 10\n   - Reduced pool_timeout from 30s to 10s (fail fast)\n   - Set command_timeout to 15s (was 30s)\n   - Set statement_timeout to 15s (was 30s)\n   - Disabled SQL echo logging to reduce overhead\n   - Recycle connections every 5 minutes (was 10 minutes)\n\n3. Docker Health Check Configuration\n   - Increased interval from 30s to 60s\n   - Reduced timeout from 10s to 5s\n   - Added --max-time 4s to curl command\n   - Increased start-period from 40s to 60s\n\n4. Dependencies Fix\n   - Fixed DatabaseManager import error\n   - Corrected get_database_session to use AsyncSessionLocal directly\n\nResults:\n- Health checks now complete in <500ms (was timing out after 10s)\n- Container status: healthy (was unhealthy)\n- Database pool utilization: 0% idle (was exhausted)\n- Memory usage: 220MB RSS (stable)\n- Event loop: 6 pending tasks (was blocked)\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"97f4b8c7043f7cbe309f148079f438b81c0157a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/97f4b8c7043f7cbe309f148079f438b81c0157a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/f68c7a29c422b892113dcc0e0835b7be95915cde","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/f68c7a29c422b892113dcc0e0835b7be95915cde","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKGY2OGM3YTI5YzQyMmI4OTIxMTNkY2MwZTA4MzViN2JlOTU5MTVjZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/66370ce03ecfc14d7e162700d0ec9d1697b49118","sha":"66370ce03ecfc14d7e162700d0ec9d1697b49118","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/66370ce03ecfc14d7e162700d0ec9d1697b49118"}],"sha":"f68c7a29c422b892113dcc0e0835b7be95915cde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/f68c7a29c422b892113dcc0e0835b7be95915cde"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/66370ce03ecfc14d7e162700d0ec9d1697b49118/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-20T16:56:46Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-20T16:56:46Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"docs: Add comprehensive frontend API configuration fix documentation","tree":{"sha":"4f00e3e73d61a33eec9009c4a94d49bbd3bb53e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/4f00e3e73d61a33eec9009c4a94d49bbd3bb53e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/66370ce03ecfc14d7e162700d0ec9d1697b49118","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/66370ce03ecfc14d7e162700d0ec9d1697b49118","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDY2MzcwY2UwM2VjZmMxNGQ3ZTE2MjcwMGQwZWM5ZDE2OTdiNDkxMTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/98522bd380af5f48ac10453e15afab663e8faf2c","sha":"98522bd380af5f48ac10453e15afab663e8faf2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/98522bd380af5f48ac10453e15afab663e8faf2c"}],"sha":"66370ce03ecfc14d7e162700d0ec9d1697b49118","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/66370ce03ecfc14d7e162700d0ec9d1697b49118"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/98522bd380af5f48ac10453e15afab663e8faf2c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-20T16:56:14Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-20T16:56:14Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Configure frontend API client for Docker networking\n\n- Set REACT_APP_API_URL to empty string for relative URLs\n- Updated docker-compose.yml to use relative paths\n- Frontend now properly connects through nginx proxy\n- Nginx proxies /api requests to backend container\n\nThis fixes 401/499 errors and frontend container health issues","tree":{"sha":"dd2a203e8accbd644bfa774f643bea7d591e310c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/dd2a203e8accbd644bfa774f643bea7d591e310c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/98522bd380af5f48ac10453e15afab663e8faf2c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/98522bd380af5f48ac10453e15afab663e8faf2c","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDk4NTIyYmQzODBhZjVmNDhhYzEwNDUzZTE1YWZhYjY2M2U4ZmFmMmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/d1a2deb9f906192c81e24133f228f84cc6e5e7b8","sha":"d1a2deb9f906192c81e24133f228f84cc6e5e7b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/d1a2deb9f906192c81e24133f228f84cc6e5e7b8"}],"sha":"98522bd380af5f48ac10453e15afab663e8faf2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/98522bd380af5f48ac10453e15afab663e8faf2c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/d1a2deb9f906192c81e24133f228f84cc6e5e7b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-20T16:17:15Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-20T16:17:15Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Resolve 401 redirect issue - clear tokens directly in interceptor\n\nThe interceptor was trying to call authService.logout() before authService\nwas defined, causing a ReferenceError that prevented the redirect to login.\n\nChanges:\n- Removed authService.logout() call from response interceptor\n- Clear accessToken and csrfToken directly inline instead\n- Added console log for debugging token refresh failures\n- Simplified error handling to avoid forward reference issues\n\nIssue: When token refresh failed with 401, the error handler would crash\ntrying to access undefined authService, preventing the redirect to /login.\nUsers would stay on the page showing 401 errors instead of being redirected.\n\nTesting:\n- 401 response now properly clears tokens\n- Redirect to /login works correctly\n- No more undefined reference errors\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"989d70d22273327dfa87953eb2c1b472b8b1a436","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/989d70d22273327dfa87953eb2c1b472b8b1a436"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/d1a2deb9f906192c81e24133f228f84cc6e5e7b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/d1a2deb9f906192c81e24133f228f84cc6e5e7b8","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKGQxYTJkZWI5ZjkwNjE5MmM4MWUyNDEzM2YyMjhmODRjYzZlNWU3Yjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/85790e55364a191de306307f2ec5c11415ec7ed9","sha":"85790e55364a191de306307f2ec5c11415ec7ed9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/85790e55364a191de306307f2ec5c11415ec7ed9"}],"sha":"d1a2deb9f906192c81e24133f228f84cc6e5e7b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/d1a2deb9f906192c81e24133f228f84cc6e5e7b8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/85790e55364a191de306307f2ec5c11415ec7ed9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-20T06:21:25Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-20T06:21:25Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Resolve backend hang and API errors (CRITICAL FIX)\n\nROOT CAUSE IDENTIFIED AND FIXED:\nThe timeout_middleware was causing anyio.WouldBlock errors that made\nthe backend hang and become unresponsive after 20-30 minutes.\n\nChanges:\n1. REMOVED timeout_middleware (main.py:113-135)\n   - asyncio.wait_for() was leaving request streams in invalid state\n   - Caused anyio.WouldBlock errors on subsequent requests\n   - Database timeouts are handled at connection level instead\n\n2. Fixed Notification-Employee relationship (models.py)\n   - Added back_populates=\"notifications\" to Notification.employee\n   - Added notifications relationship to Employee model\n   - Fixes AttributeError: Notification has no attribute ''employee''\n\n3. Fixed Department cyclic reference (schemas.py)\n   - Changed parent: DepartmentResponse to parent_id: int\n   - Prevents infinite recursion in parent-child serialization\n   - Fixes pydantic RecursionError\n\nBenefits:\n- Backend no longer hangs after 20-30 minutes\n- No more anyio.WouldBlock ASGI exceptions\n- Departments API works without recursion errors\n- Notifications API works with proper relationships\n- Proper 401 responses instead of 500 errors\n\nTesting:\n✅ Backend healthy and stable\n✅ No ASGI exceptions in logs\n✅ APIs return proper status codes\n✅ Login and authentication working\n\nRelated: BACKEND_HANG_ISSUE.md\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6097d1e2dfc8ce9dced028b4bc391c12b9b73332","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/6097d1e2dfc8ce9dced028b4bc391c12b9b73332"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/85790e55364a191de306307f2ec5c11415ec7ed9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/85790e55364a191de306307f2ec5c11415ec7ed9","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDg1NzkwZTU1MzY0YTE5MWRlMzA2MzA3ZjJlYzVjMTE0MTVlYzdlZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/0b7d3dcb08b1c7daca3c582e5879f804384f60d2","sha":"0b7d3dcb08b1c7daca3c582e5879f804384f60d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/0b7d3dcb08b1c7daca3c582e5879f804384f60d2"}],"sha":"85790e55364a191de306307f2ec5c11415ec7ed9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/85790e55364a191de306307f2ec5c11415ec7ed9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/0b7d3dcb08b1c7daca3c582e5879f804384f60d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-20T05:23:10Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-20T05:23:10Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Add comprehensive backend monitoring and fix notifications API\n\nPermanent fixes for backend stability and monitoring:\n\n1. Fixed notifications API TypeError\n   - Changed user_id to employee_id parameter in get_notifications endpoint\n   - Aligns with CRUDNotification.get_multi_with_filters() signature\n\n2. Created comprehensive monitoring system (monitoring.py)\n   - Database connection pool monitoring (size, checked_out, overflow, utilization)\n   - Event loop health tracking (pending tasks, blocking detection)\n   - Memory usage monitoring (RSS, VMS, Python allocations with tracemalloc)\n   - Warning thresholds: >80% pool, >100 pending tasks, >500MB memory\n   - Critical alerts: pool exhausted, >500 pending tasks, >1GB memory\n\n3. Enhanced application lifecycle (main.py)\n   - Added startup event with health monitoring initialization\n   - Added shutdown event for graceful cleanup\n   - Added error handling to prevent startup failures\n   - Added /health/detailed endpoint for real-time metrics\n\n4. Added psutil dependency\n   - Enables process-level memory monitoring\n   - Required for comprehensive health metrics\n\nBenefits:\n- Real-time visibility into backend health via /health/detailed\n- Early warning system for resource exhaustion\n- Helps identify root cause of backend hangs (DB pool, event loop, memory)\n- Graceful degradation if monitoring fails\n\nRelated: BACKEND_HANG_ISSUE.md\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ffd9589e6424556ed48e0779c9c8ccb3b351aa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/2ffd9589e6424556ed48e0779c9c8ccb3b351aa2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/0b7d3dcb08b1c7daca3c582e5879f804384f60d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/0b7d3dcb08b1c7daca3c582e5879f804384f60d2","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDBiN2QzZGNiMDhiMWM3ZGFjYTNjNTgyZTU4NzlmODA0Mzg0ZjYwZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/6cf933d5db5502c743ce53344338f5a75e1c3f98","sha":"6cf933d5db5502c743ce53344338f5a75e1c3f98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/6cf933d5db5502c743ce53344338f5a75e1c3f98"}],"sha":"0b7d3dcb08b1c7daca3c582e5879f804384f60d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/0b7d3dcb08b1c7daca3c582e5879f804384f60d2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/6cf933d5db5502c743ce53344338f5a75e1c3f98/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-20T05:04:26Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-20T05:04:26Z","email":"developer@aischedulemanager.com","name":"AI Schedule Manager Dev"},"message":"fix: Resolve API routing and authentication issues\n\nCritical fixes for employee management and department visibility issues:\n\n**Authentication Issues:**\n- Fix auth token not being sent with API requests\n- Initialize access token from localStorage on api.js module load\n- Add comprehensive logging for token management and API requests\n- Ensure token is properly stored and retrieved across page reloads\n\n**Employee Management Fixes:**\n- Fix employees GET response handling (backend returns array directly, not wrapped)\n- Remove .employees accessor that was causing empty employee list\n- Disable department field in employee form until backend fully supports it\n- Add PATCH endpoint support to employees.py (frontend uses PATCH for updates)\n- Add validation to exclude department field from employee creation payload\n\n**Department Management Fixes:**\n- Fix department tree building to use camelCase field names (parentId)\n- Add comprehensive logging for department API responses\n- Verify PaginatedResponse structure is correctly processed\n\n**API Service Enhancements:**\n- Add detailed request/response logging in interceptors\n- Log data transformation (snake_case <-> camelCase) for debugging\n- Add token set/clear logging for troubleshooting auth issues\n- Improve error messages with more context\n\n**Backend Changes:**\n- Add @router.patch decorator to employee update endpoint\n- Support both PUT and PATCH methods for employee updates\n\n**Files Modified:**\n- frontend/src/pages/EmployeesPage.jsx\n- frontend/src/pages/DepartmentManager.jsx\n- frontend/src/services/api.js\n- backend/src/api/employees.py\n\n**Testing Required:**\n1. Verify auth token is sent with all API requests\n2. Confirm employee list loads correctly\n3. Test employee creation (without department)\n4. Verify department list displays all departments including Pathology\n5. Check browser console logs for detailed API interaction info\n\nFixes #EMPLOYEE_ADD_422 #DEPARTMENT_VISIBILITY #AUTH_TOKEN_MISSING\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"19b7d0f70471112752d96e0ea0bd5579b36d64f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/trees/19b7d0f70471112752d96e0ea0bd5579b36d64f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/git/commits/6cf933d5db5502c743ce53344338f5a75e1c3f98","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/6cf933d5db5502c743ce53344338f5a75e1c3f98","node_id":"C_kwDOPgFa5toAKDZjZjkzM2Q1ZGI1NTAyYzc0M2NlNTMzNDQzMzhmNWE3NWUxYzNmOTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commit/7dfd3a586d183970af2f70a886bfbc4bd4418504","sha":"7dfd3a586d183970af2f70a886bfbc4bd4418504","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/7dfd3a586d183970af2f70a886bfbc4bd4418504"}],"sha":"6cf933d5db5502c743ce53344338f5a75e1c3f98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits/6cf933d5db5502c743ce53344338f5a75e1c3f98"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/TingTung93/AI-Schedule-Manager/commits?per_page=100&page=2&sha=36f8868e1ae2d3b94b0341a0f7a478b61eaf8d17&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A16%3A48.190Z"}');
