her_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayatyner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mayatyner","id":86429668,"login":"mayatyner","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NDI5NjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayatyner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayatyner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayatyner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayatyner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayatyner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayatyner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/commits/bde90f7b5cd4bd3ec56077072d5098a16a3f0e9b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-29T21:16:12Z","email":"maya.tyner@instructure.com","name":"Maya Tyner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-14T21:09:43Z","email":"maya.tyner@instructure.com","name":"Maya Tyner"},"message":"use react-pacer to prevent rate-limiting errors\n\nsubaccounts does lots of concurrent requests\nby using react-pacer, we can limit the number of concurrent requests\n\nin this case, down to 2 requests with a 1 second delay\nif a query takes longer than 10 seconds, move on to the next item\nthat query will stay pending and can still complete the fetch request\n\nrefs FOO-5628\nflag=none\n\ntest-plan:\n- create a many nested subaccounts\n- visit subaccounts\n- EXPECT requests to execute with more delay\n- EXPECT expanding/infinite scrolling to have NO delay\n- EXPECT queue to progress if queries are too slow (10 seconds)\n\t- queries should NOT be cancelled/aborted\n- EXPECT failed fetches to render an error message in the UI\n\t- next query should start\nChange-Id: I25fce0a6842c50b018269fdbffb5fcc1e964de38\n\nChange-Id: I44cb9a69cb7383233f3f742c5326dff51bcd1e4f\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/385276\nReviewed-by: Charley 