d3ba57"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/commits/1083dc04d03b33fd324fbfa17918ebf0f6fd6563/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-14T15:17:51Z","email":"hannah.roach@instructure.com","name":"Hannah Roach"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-14T18:55:08Z","email":"hannah.roach@instructure.com","name":"Hannah Roach"},"message":"add Create a new Module link that opens the Add Module tray\n\nwhen there are no modules on a page, the Create a new Module\nicon and link should appear. This tickets implements that\nfeatures. When a user clicks on the icon, the Add Module\nside tray opens.\n\nfixes LX-3141\nflag=modules_page_rewrite\n\ntest plan:\n1. create a course\n2. observe that there is a Create a new Module link and icon\n3. click on the icon or link\n4. observe that the Add Module side tray appears\n5. create a module\n6. observe that the Create a new Module link and icon is\nreplaced with the added module\n\nChange-Id: I7a386c88ebce35cb60fc3ffc72d490bfa74532e2\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/386263\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Jaime Lozano <jaime.lozano@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Jaime Lozano <jaime.lozano@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Hannah Roach <hannah.roach@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"e9dce8351d59e03fc7ef2a75cb3b1b984aceeaff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/git/trees/e9dce8351d59e03fc7ef2a75cb3b1b984aceeaff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/git/commits/1083dc04d03b33fd324fbfa17918ebf0f6fd6563","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/aianta/canvas-evaluation/commit/1083dc04d03b33fd324fbfa17918ebf0f6fd6563","node_id":"C_kwDOPgJdNtoAKDEwODNkYzA0ZDAzYjMzZmQzMjRmYmZhMTc5MThlYmYwZjZmZDY1NjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aianta/canvas-evaluation/commit/491c92d4f78151bc09d8a4aaaf85103b642872e2","sha":"491c92d4f78151bc09d8a4aaaf85103b642872e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/commits/491c92d4f78151bc09d8a4aaaf85103b642872e2"}],"sha":"1083dc04d03b33fd324fbfa17918ebf0f6fd6563","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/commits/1083dc04d03b33fd324fbfa17918ebf0f6fd6563"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/commits/491c92d4f78151bc09d8a4aaaf85103b642872e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-13T20:55:02Z","email":"hannah.roach@instructure.com","name":"Hannah Roach"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-14T18:20:36Z","email":"hannah.roach@instructure.com","name":"Hannah Roach"},"message":"adjust pagination spacing according\n\nthis ticket is to adjust the pagination spacing so that the space\nbetween the pagination text and page numbers is 8px and the space\nbetween the pagination text and edge of the module is 32px.\n\nfixes LX-3095\nflag=modules_page_rewrite\nflag=modules_page_rewrite_student_view\n\ntest plan:\n1. create a course with a module and two or more pages of\nmodule items\n2. verify that the space between the pagination text and\nthe page numbers is 8px\n3. verify that the space between the pagination text and\nthe edge of the module is 32px\n\nChange-Id: I81b82540da39cd07a0e6d98fa0379283cb5df27d\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/386191\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Jaime Lozano <jaime.lozano@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Jaime Lozano <jaime.lozano@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Hannah Roach <hannah.roach@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"82ac25bf5b1f7da7d55c14baf40b012402cf5d34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/git/trees/82ac25bf5b1f7da7d55c14baf40b012402cf5d34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/git/commits/491c92d4f78151bc09d8a4aaaf85103b642872e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/aianta/canvas-evaluation/commit/491c92d4f78151bc09d8a4aaaf85103b642872e2","node_id":"C_kwDOPgJdNtoAKDQ5MWM5MmQ0Zjc4MTUxYmMwOWQ4YTRhYWFmODUxMDNiNjQyODcyZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aianta/canvas-evaluation/commit/d64ba98ff890e3583859b47b74565ddefd237b91","sha":"d64ba98ff890e3583859b47b74565ddefd237b91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/commits/d64ba98ff890e3583859b47b74565ddefd237b91"}],"sha":"491c92d4f78151bc09d8a4aaaf85103b642872e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/commits/491c92d4f78151bc09d8a4aaaf85103b642872e2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6576592?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cvkline/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cvkline/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cvkline/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cvkline/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cvkline","id":6576592,"login":"cvkline","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzY1OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cvkline/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cvkline/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cvkline/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cvkline/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cvkline/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cvkline","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/commits/d64ba98ff890e3583859b47b74565ddefd237b91/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-12T22:45:16Z","email":"ckline@instructure.com","name":"Charley Kline"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-14T17:41:31Z","email":"c