"parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aianta/canvas-evaluation/commit/561b6e334ef6c0209dfb3f2529479e1c9f6407a6","sha":"561b6e334ef6c0209dfb3f2529479e1c9f6407a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/commits/561b6e334ef6c0209dfb3f2529479e1c9f6407a6"}],"sha":"ecb5c380cd9f7f80d22be17497da2244c328db4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/commits/ecb5c380cd9f7f80d22be17497da2244c328db4c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108301393?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarah-gerard","id":108301393,"login":"sarah-gerard","node_id":"U_kgDOBnSMUQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/commits/561b6e334ef6c0209dfb3f2529479e1c9f6407a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-13T20:44:29Z","email":"sarah.gerard@instructure.com","name":"Sarah Gerard"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-14T17:28:45Z","email":"sarah.gerard@instructure.com","name":"Sarah Gerard"},"message":"Only disable Expand All when modules are expanded and loading\n\nBefore, expand all would be disabled whenever we were refetching\nany modules. This meant that it would disable when using\nfunctionality like the bulk publish/unpublish. Expand all\nshould only disable when the user expands all modules\nand user is waiting for those modules to be fetched.\n\ncloses LX-3069\nflag=modules_page_rewrite\n\ntest plan:\n- have some modules and some items\n- click expand all\n- while waiting for the modules to load, expand all should\n  be disabled\n- should be enabled again once modules are fetched\n- subsequent collapse/expand all clicks should not disable the\n  button, as the modules have already been fetched\n- on an individual module, click the publish icon and choose\n  any of the 4 options\n- collapse/expand all button should not disable while the module\n  updates and is refetched\n- same for the bulk module publish update menus and module item\n  publish buttons.\n\nChange-Id: I9b0c3cda061ff761afeac0441bfce8a295edc01a\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/386189\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Eric Saupe <eric.saupe@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Eric Saupe <eric.saupe@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Drake Harper <drake.harper@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Zoe Lubitz <zoe.lubitz@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"434db093df3d70053e684d77cdfb87a02529560d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/git/trees/434db093df3d70053e684d77cdfb87a02529560d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/git/commits/561b6e334ef6c0209dfb3f2529479e1c9f6407a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108301393?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"http