ae76855eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/commits/e3325b968d83792f887ed08e4f50a0eae76855eb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25394106?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drakeaharper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drakeaharper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drakeaharper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drakeaharper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/drakeaharper","id":25394106,"login":"drakeaharper","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Mzk0MTA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drakeaharper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drakeaharper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drakeaharper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drakeaharper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drakeaharper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/drakeaharper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/commits/a2352e8b8b157f124dfb73e305c6cd56f6052948/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-07T03:40:11Z","email":"drake.harper@instructure.com","name":"Drake Harper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-13T17:43:50Z","email":"drake.harper@instructure.com","name":"Drake Harper"},"message":"Add show all/less button to react modules pages\n\nflag=modules_page_rewrite\ncloses LX-2890\n\nTest Plan:\n- create a course with 100+ module items\n- at least one module needs more than 10 items\n- should see show all/less button\n- clicking should all modules (fetched in pages of 100)\n- clicking again should show the paginated view again\n\n- show all/less state should be saved to local storage\n - refreshing page when show all is active should stay active\n\n- switching to a page in a module should be saved to local storage\n - refreshing page while viewing page 2 or later should be active\n   after refreshing\n\nChange-Id: I27ec66725fbd2caba24e0680a19367430d716d11\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/385613\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Sarah Gerard <sarah.gerard@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Sarah Gerard <sarah.gerard@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Zoe Lubitz <zoe.lubitz@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"7eb0efa53facd1f4991d7bdddd5610134cf27dc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/git/trees/7eb0efa53facd1f4991d7bdddd5610134cf27dc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/git/commits/a2352e8b8b157f124dfb73e305c6cd56f6052948","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25394106?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drakeaharper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drakeaharper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drakeaharper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drakeaharper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/drakeaharper","id":25394106,"login":"drakeaharper","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Mzk0MTA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drakeaharper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drakeaharper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drakeaharper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drakeaharper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drakeaharper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/drakeaharper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aianta/canvas-evaluation/commit/a2352e8b8b157f124dfb73e305c6cd56f6052948","node_id":"C_kwDOPgJdNtoAKGEyMzUyZThiOGIxNTdmMTI0ZGZiNzNlMzA1YzZjZDU2ZjYwNTI5NDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aianta/canvas-evaluation/commit/28104a432b0bbf48670155f25dafc2a98b73c7d7","sha":"28104a432b0bbf48670155f25dafc2a98b73c7d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/commits/28104a432b0bbf48670155f25dafc2a98b73c7d7"}],"sha":"a2352e8b8b157f124dfb73e305c6cd56f6052948","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/commits/a2352e8b8b157f124dfb73e305c6cd56f6052948"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42885142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hawkbawk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hawkbawk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hawkbawk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hawkbawk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hawkbawk","id":42885142,"login":"Hawkbawk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODg1MTQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hawkbawk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hawkbawk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hawkbawk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hawkbawk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hawkbawk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hawkbawk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/commits/28104a432b0bbf48670155f25dafc2a98b73c7d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-11T22:44:49Z","email":"ryan.hawkins@instructure.com","name":"Ryan Hawkins"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-13T17:19:16Z","email":"ryan.hawkins@instructure.com","name":"Ryan Hawkins"},"message":"Fix invalid registration URL for test envs\n\nwhy:\n- In a specific case (an institution has multiple domains, their\n  Instructure domain is a redirect, and they are installing a dynamic\n  registration tool in test/beta), then we would incorrectly generate\n  the registration URL to point at production, rather than test or beta.\n- Don''t do that anymore. Use the host of the request to determine which\n  environment we''re in.\n- Additionally, make the registration endpoint use the auth_domain as\n  host, as the Dynamic Registration specification actually requires that\n  the registration endpoint be on the same domain as the issuer in the\n  configuration.\n\ncloses INTEROP-9607\n\ntest-plan:\n- tbh this one is *hard* to test as it depends on some pretty specific configuration things being set up. Steps that should work:\n1. Have a root account with multiple domains.\n2. Make one of those domains redirect to the other domain.\n3. Modify your local security.yml file to use something like:\n  `https://canvas.beta.<your_regular_canvas_url>`\n4. Run Canvas in production mode or comment out the environment check\n   in Lti::Oidc.auth_domain so that it actually uses your configured\n   issuer.\n5. Make sure you restart your Canvas after changing all of this.\n6. Get an authorized URL for getting the openid configuration\n   (GET /api/lti/accounts/:account_id/registration_token)\n7. Get the configuration and make sure the URLs all point to the issuer\n   domain that you have configured, especially the\n   registration_endpoint key.\n\nChange-Id: I971d21676fa4a78c07dee2719f169d16e061271a\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/385923\nReviewed-by: Xander Moffatt <xmoffatt@instructure.com>\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Paul Gray <paul.gray@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Paul Gray <paul.gray@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Paul Gray <paul.gray@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"6f464f825548f84f8046a5fb7ee1bc2d87d1762d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation/git/trees/6f464f825548f84f8046a5fb7ee1bc2d87d1762d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/canvas-evaluation